<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:98c4844c-a16a-4b8b-9928-d9846dcb2d25">
              <SHORT-NAME>BswM</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the BswM (Basic SW Mode Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswM (Bsw Mode Manager) 是负责管理基础软件模块（Bsw）模式之间切换的组件，它根据来自应用层或其他Bsw模块的模式请求，控制Bsw模块间的模式切换。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswM时，需要确保所有模式请求的来源和目标模式都被正确定义；BswM的配置应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对模式管理逻辑的要求；在多模式复杂系统中，设计BswM逻辑时要特别注意避免模式切换的死锁情况。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01063</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:80f40234-216b-48cd-a96c-4eeab986d79c">
                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the AUTOSAR BswM module. This  container exists once per partition.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMConfig 是用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）的配置参数，它包括模块的功能和行为配置，如模式管理、规则和动作列表等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMConfig时，必须确保所有的模式请求、规则和动作都已经正确定义并且相互匹配；BswMConfig的配置应该与系统的功能需求和依赖关系保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，BswM的配置可能需要与新的功能和改进的标准兼容。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00895</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:90db6563-0e69-4aef-94c9-450fab982ecd">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This references the partition the BswM shall run inside.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPartitionRef是一个配置项，用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）的分区引用，确保模块能够在指定的内存分区中运行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMPartitionRef时，需要确保引用的分区符合AUTOSAR的内存分区规范；分区配置应与ECU的内存管理策略相匹配；在多核或多分区系统中，应注意不同分区间的数据共享和同步机制。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00984</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucPartitionCollection/EcucPartition</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="a79d741c-4fea-410b-a9e7-7e504b78466e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeDclGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container describes a ModeDeclarationGroup which is created by the BswM.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeDclGroup是用于声明BSW模块模式的一组配置，它允许定义模块在不同操作模式下的行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在定义BswMRteModeDclGroup时，需要确保模式声明与BSW模块的实际行为一致；每个BSW模块应有其对应的模式声明，以便于系统管理和模式切换；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求模式管理机制明确，因此在配置时应注意满足标准的要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="DV:CfgPostBuild">
                            <SD GID="DV:postBuildSelectableChangeable">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="DV:postBuildNotDeletable">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The following elements are created in the BswM_swc.arxml:
                        - ModeDeclarationGroup with the name of this container.
                        - ModeSwitchInterface which uses the ModeDeclarationGroup as its ModeDeclarationGroupPrototpye 
                        - ImplementationType with a CompuMethod which contains all Modes of the ModeDeclarationGroup
                        - DataTypeMappingSet which maps the Mode Declaration Group to the ImplementationType
                          </L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <POST-BUILD-CHANGEABLE>false</POST-BUILD-CHANGEABLE>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="3090c7e4-4d16-4212-95fb-8bb324b5225f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMInitMode</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Mode of this ModeDeclarationGroup. Target is used as InitalMode of the ModeDeclarationGroup.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMInitMode配置项定义了基本软件模块管理（BswM）的初始化模式，这是BswM模块在系统启动时的行为配置，用于控制BswM如何初始化其管理的资源和模块。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMInitMode时，需要确保它与系统的启动策略和依赖模块的初始化顺序相匹配；此外，BswMInitMode的配置应该遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于模块初始化模式的规定；在多模式系统中，还需要考虑模式切换对初始化模式的影响。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD-LOADABLE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD-SELECTABLE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-INDEX>false</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMRteModeDclGroup/BswMRteMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ddf1daef-b288-4801-98cd-7e109d53952a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteMode</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container describes a Mode of a ModeDeclarationGroup.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteMode配置项定义了基本软件模块（BswM）与运行时环境（RTE）之间的模式切换逻辑，用于控制和管理软件组件的行为模式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRteMode时，需要确保模式之间的转换逻辑清晰且无歧义；模式切换应考虑系统的实时性和安全性要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对模式管理有详细规范，需遵循相关规则以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="DV:CfgPostBuild">
                                <SD GID="DV:postBuildSelectableChangeable">false</SD>
                                <SD GID="DV:postBuildNotDeletable">false</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The name of the container represents the name of the corresponding Mode.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <POST-BUILD-CHANGEABLE>false</POST-BUILD-CHANGEABLE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="f1e043b2-c4f1-4d73-b7a4-c2aca5bcc77d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMModePhysicalValue</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Describes the physical value of the Mode. Value is used in the CompuMehod of the ImplemenationType.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModePhysicalValue 用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）中的模式控制值，这些值与物理设备状态或操作模式直接相关。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保BswMModePhysicalValue与实际物理设备或操作模式的状态匹配；在配置时考虑系统的安全和性能需求；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应确保这些值的更新和管理遵循标准的模式管理策略。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD-LOADABLE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD-SELECTABLE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </IMPLEMENTATION-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <REQUIRES-INDEX>false</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>                  
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1bb152a0-b36c-460c-bada-c3347399266e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMArbitration</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all configuration sub-containers and parameters related to the mode arbitration functionality of the BswM.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMArbitration配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）的仲裁逻辑，这涉及到模块间的优先级和控制决策，以确保系统中不同模块的协调运行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMArbitration时，必须确保所有参与仲裁的模块的优先级和决策逻辑正确定义，以避免潜在的资源冲突或死锁；此外，仲裁逻辑应当与系统的实时性和安全性要求相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关规范来配置仲裁逻辑，以确保与标准的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00801</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:899ba0a7-d309-4157-a38c-15331b2b7164">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMEventRequestPort</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this container defines an event which can be sent to the BswM. Basic Software Modules may send these events to the BswM by calling the corresponding BswM C-API (for example: BswM_ComM_InitiateReset()).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEventRequestPort 配置项用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）组件中的事件请求端口，这些端口用于接收来自其他软件组件的事件通知。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEventRequestPort时，需要确保端口的标识符与系统中其他端口的标识符不冲突；端口的类型和数据元素需要与发送事件的组件匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，BswM的配置应遵循模块的定义和规范，确保端口配置的正确性和一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b812763f-5620-4e1d-ac70-b64175dab883">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMEventRequestProcessing</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if the processing of the mode arbitration shall be done immediately when an event request is received or if it shall be deferred to the processing of the main function of BswM.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEventRequestProcessing配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）如何处理来自各种软件组件的事件请求，包括事件的触发方式和处理优先级。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEventRequestProcessing时，需要确保事件处理策略与系统的实时性和安全性要求相符；此外，应注意不同事件可能需要不同的处理策略，例如立即处理或延迟处理；最后，配置时应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对事件请求处理的相关规定，以保证配置的一致性和系统的可靠性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01056</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_DEFERRED</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:be132364-f781-d1a1-e669-d75e1098d41e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_DEFERRED</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:70047f54-4c93-d4c3-d447-1c519baa4a86">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_IMMEDIATE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e4026e62-cdc2-4be6-955e-8e8693ceefb8">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMEventRequestSource</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This choice container specifies the source of the event request. The sender of the event can be another BSW Module, such as ComM.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEventRequestSource配置项用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）中的事件请求源，这些请求源触发BswM对特定模式的切换或行为的执行。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEventRequestSource时，必须确保每个事件请求源的标识符在整个系统中是唯一的；配置的事件请求源应与实际系统中的事件产生机制相匹配，以确保正确的模式切换；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对事件请求源的处理和配置方法可能有特定的要求和限制，需要仔细遵守相关规范。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01053</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:75204455-e2df-4a71-8ca6-d8c006956631">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMInitiateReset</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication from the ComM to signal a shutdown.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMInitiateReset配置项用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）如何处理来自通信管理模块（ComM）的重置请求，确保系统能够根据需要安全地重启或进入特定的重置状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMInitiateReset时，需要确保重置策略与系统的安全需求相匹配；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能需要与ECU的重置管理功能紧密集成，确保兼容性；设计时应考虑重置请求的来源和条件，以避免意外触发重置。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01014</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ccb455cd-746c-48e3-a406-201cc4294c40">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMDcmApplicationUpdatedIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a request to update application data from the DCM. This container does not contain any parameters since there are no further configuration needed for this type of request.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMDcmApplicationUpdatedIndication是一个配置项，用于指示基础软件模块（BswM）当诊断通信管理器（Dcm）完成了ECU固件更新后，应当执行的动作或状态变更。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保Dcm模块与BswM模块之间的接口和数据交互正确定义，以便在固件更新后能够正确地通知BswM；此配置项通常与ECU固件更新流程紧密相关，因此需要根据具体的应用场景和项目需求进行配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相应的模块交互规范和数据定义，以确保系统的兼容性和稳定性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00925</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f66b3d92-e79d-46aa-8be6-009f3b69562e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeSwitchErrorEvent</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification that an error occurred because the partition containing mode users of the referenced PPort was restarted by the RTE. Because the Mode Machine Instance holding the current mode can reside on that terminated partition, the Mode Manager has to be informed about</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeSwitchErrorEvent 用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）中的模式切换错误事件，这些事件通常用于处理模式切换过程中发生的错误或异常。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保正确配置错误处理逻辑以增强系统的健壮性；在设计模式切换策略时，应详细定义可能的错误类型和相应的恢复策略；此配置项应与系统的诊断策略紧密结合，以便于错误追踪和系统恢复。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">the loss of this partition.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00990</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8ca1d416-76a7-4ea3-9519-31439326e73b">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteSwitchPortRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the BswMSwitchPort.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01030</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMModeControl/BswMSwitchPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b5945b70-02da-4c99-98f5-387bfe6563de">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMNmCarWakeUpIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of a CarWakeup from the Nm.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNmCarWakeUpIndication是一个配置项，用于指示网络管理（Nm）模块接收到车辆唤醒指示时应采取的行动，这通常涉及到网络的状态转换或特定动作的执行。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保与车辆的唤醒逻辑兼容；该配置项的行为应与系统的低功耗和唤醒策略紧密结合；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确定义此配置项，具体实现可能依赖于供应商或项目具体要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6a174a35-c5e9-4a25-8e2c-f765f4063bef">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMNmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the channel handle that the indication corresponds to.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01049</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:459e370f-0bb1-440a-a616-2decffbaf397">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMPartitionRestarted</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification that an error occured because the partition containing the BswM was restarted by the RTE. The Mode Users may lie in another (still running) partition. So the BswM has to be informed that the start of its partition is no normal startup but a restart of a single partition. This information can be used inside the Rules. This notification  has to be used by the Restart Task of the particular partition.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPartitionRestarted 配置项用于指示基础软件模块分区（BswM Partition）在系统复位后是否被重新启动。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保系统设计能够适应分区重启的情况；此配置项的使用应与系统复位策略和安全要求相一致；在配置时，应考虑分区重启对系统状态和通信的影响。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00989</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:77b44dcd-e54f-4030-bdbc-ecdd6e569ce4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMWdgMRequestPartitionReset</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a Partition Reset request from from the WdgM. This port</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMWdgMRequestPartitionReset 配置项用于定义基础软件模块监控看门狗（WdgM）请求分区重置的属性，这是为了确保系统在检测到严重错误时能够安全地恢复。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保分区重置请求与系统分区管理策略一致；分区重置请求应当仅在检测到无法恢复的错误时发起；配置时需考虑与其他安全机制的协同，如Error Handling和Supervision。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">corresponds to a call of the BswM_WdgM_RequestPartitionReset API.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00916</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6770d76c-a522-43c4-961f-26d1d6e61afa">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMWdgMRequestPartitionResetRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the partition that shall be reset.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMWdgMRequestPartitionResetRef 配置项用于定义基本软件模块监控看门狗管理器（WdgM）请求分区重置的引用，这允许WdgM在检测到错误时重置特定的软件分区。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的分区是可重置的，并且分区重置的策略与系统的安全要求相符；此配置项应与系统分区管理策略和错误处理策略紧密结合；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用与标准规定的模块间接口和行为一致。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00917</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucPartitionCollection/EcucPartition</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:24badaf3-6672-43f0-b3b0-3343c67796e6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMLogicalExpression</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container describes the logical expressions that can be used for the mode arbitration. The logical expressions are built of a set of arguments and a logical operator.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMLogicalExpression是AUTOSAR BSW模块管理（BswM）的一部分，用于定义布尔逻辑表达式，这些表达式基于不同的输入来控制BSW模块的行为。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMLogicalExpression时，必须确保所使用的表达式符合AUTOSAR的逻辑运算规则；表达式中引用的每个元素都必须在系统中有定义且可达；逻辑表达式的复杂度应当考虑到系统资源和性能的限制。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Each argument can either be a mode condition or a sub-expression to allow definition of more complex logical expressions.
                                                There may be an unlimited number of arguments in each logical expression.
                                                Note that the order of evaluation of the expressions is not defined.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00808</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:71652a7c-9360-42b3-9432-2cd58bfe7949">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMLogicalOperator</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies the logical operator to be used in the logical expression. If the logical operator is set to something other than BSWM_NOT, and the expression only consists of a single condition, then this parameter will have no effect.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMLogicalOperator 是 AUTOSAR BSW Module Management (BswM) 的一个配置参数，用于定义逻辑表达式中使用的逻辑运算符，如 AND、OR、NOT 等，以便在决定模块模式请求时进行条件判断。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置逻辑表达式时，需要确保使用的逻辑运算符与所需的逻辑行为相匹配；逻辑运算符的使用应遵循AUTOSAR规范中定义的语法和语义；在复杂的逻辑表达式中，应注意运算符的优先级和括号的使用，以避免逻辑错误。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00814</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_AND</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f87e5a65-29c2-8689-691c-9dfdd3f79558">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_AND</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f33c5280-44e2-8a5e-4635-67ce52facb58">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_NAND</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:af2b1129-0ffa-84d0-3e8b-754307050f9c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_NOT</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f3a087f-c03f-931f-3d60-6cfc0ee1578f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_OR</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:a85efe27-1a02-9246-3ba5-638452e9708f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_XOR</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:509833cd-a9df-4ffb-ba49-a4fea4761bf3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMArgumentRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This is a choice reference either to a mode condition or a sub-expression.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">In case the BswMLogicalExpression.BswMLogicalOperator equals BSWM_NAND only two operands are supported.
                                                        In case the BswMLogicalExpression.BswMLogicalOperator equals BSWM_NOT only one operand is supported.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00820</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REFS>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMLogicalExpression</DESTINATION-REF>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMModeCondition</DESTINATION-REF>
                              </DESTINATION-REFS>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:55038f0f-7e6c-49bf-a155-df75c068efe5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeCondition</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container describes the BswM mode conditions that can be used either by itself to form a rule or as a part of a logical expression.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeCondition配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）中的模式条件，这些条件用于控制BswM逻辑的执行，例如根据ECU的不同模式来启动或停止特定的功能。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMModeCondition时，需要确保所依赖的模式声明与实际系统模式一致；此外，对于每个模式条件的触发逻辑，应明确定义以避免逻辑冲突或不一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对模式管理有详细规范，确保遵循这些规范以保证系统的可靠性和一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00807</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4f137728-854d-4d76-aa9c-311449567f09">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMConditionType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies what kind of comparison that is made for the evaluation of the mode condition.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMConditionType是用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）中的条件类型，这些条件用于控制BswM逻辑的执行，例如模式切换或功能激活。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在定义BswMConditionType时，需要确保其与系统中的其他条件类型不冲突，并且与实际的系统需求相匹配；此外，应注意该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中的具体属性和限制，以确保兼容性和正确性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">For BSWM_EQUALS and BSWM_EQUALS_NOT, the BswMModeRequestPort port referenced by BswMConditionMode is compared with the value configured in BswMConditionValue for equality or not-equality.

                                                        For BSWM_EVENT_IS_SET and BSWM_EVENT_IS_CLEARED, the BswMEventRequestPort port referenced by BswMConditionMode is checked for being set or cleared (not-set).</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00815</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_EQUALS</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:19edad62-5e88-8f8f-55b6-32c95062c4bc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_EQUALS</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:99b74636-4546-8e0d-376d-44ae5c065b65">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_EQUALS_NOT</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:bb139eff-4776-9805-5963-dbc81ef15d1f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_EVENT_IS_CLEARED</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:44d04eb4-4907-92cd-5340-ac6e28ac0a60">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_EVENT_IS_SET</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6a6a7ef5-77b2-4220-b440-3c7ad95e6237">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMConditionMode</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references either a mode request port or an event request port.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00821</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REFS>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMEventRequestPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMModeRequestPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                              </DESTINATION-REFS>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6dfef60d-1d6f-4b42-a4ae-f32d9a3df94f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMConditionValue</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container holds the parameters and references necessary to identify the mode type and the value that the mode request is compared to.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMConditionValue是AUTOSAR BSW模块管理（BswM）的配置参数，用于定义模块管理逻辑中的条件值，这些条件值用于控制BswM逻辑执行的分支。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMConditionValue时，必须确保其值与BswM逻辑中预期的条件匹配；此外，每个条件值应该是唯一的，以避免在模块管理逻辑中的混淆；在配置过程中还应注意条件值的数据类型，确保它与BswM逻辑中使用的数据类型兼容。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00816</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a9aa03c3-81c2-4949-b63a-a84a134a3291">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMBswMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the value and type of a mode in the BSW. The mode value is defined by configuring either BswMBswRequestedMode or BswMCompuScaleModeValue.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMBswMode配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）的模式管理逻辑，包括模式切换的条件和行为，以及模式之间的转换规则。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMBswMode时，需要确保模式之间的转换逻辑清晰且无歧义；模式切换条件应当明确，避免因条件模糊导致的不确定行为；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是标准的一部分，但实现细节可能因AUTOSAR版本或供应商实现而异。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00869</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:04a0b0ee-322c-48dc-a12d-2287e87e2e44">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMBswRequestedMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the symbolic name (as a string) of a certain mode/state that can be requested/indicated by the BSW modules.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMBswRequestedMode配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）请求的模式，它指定了BswM在特定条件下应当请求的软件模块的操作模式。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与系统中其他模块的模式管理机制紧密协作，确保模式切换的一致性和正确性；在配置时需考虑系统的实时性和安全性要求；配置错误可能导致系统行为不符合预期，特别是在涉及安全相关的模块时更需谨慎。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00866</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4685297d-8985-8a31-4489-edcbcb9e0a00">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuScaleModeValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains parameters used to define a mode value.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:16f4bb59-8dcf-d830-e635-d67b22565111">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuConstText</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">The value of this parameter shall match the VT member of a CompuConst defined within the referenced CompuMethod (BswMCompuMethodRef). The interval value of the corresponding CompuScale shall be used as the mode request value.</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01041</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                            <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                          </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                      </PARAMETERS>
                                      <REFERENCES>
                                        <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:29825d40-1322-ce2b-eec3-4a727f336915">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuMethodRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the CompuMethod used for mode requests.</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <DESTINATION-TYPE>COMPU-METHOD</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                        </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                      </REFERENCES>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2ed5817c-df9e-47bd-a384-c5c818caf935">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeDeclaration</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">When the mode corresponds to a mode request or mode indication interface the mode is defined by a mode declaration. The mode declarations are defined in the SW-C Template and hence a foreign reference to the corresponding Mode Declaration is used.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeDeclaration 用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）的模式声明，这些模式用于控制和管理不同的软件模块之间的交互和行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保模式声明与系统需求和功能安全要求相匹配；模式声明应由系统架构师或相应的软件架构师定义和维护；在实现时，应注意模式切换的时序和依赖关系，避免系统不稳定或功能异常。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00868</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:16d03c04-047d-4b09-b573-5986fdeff4ed">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeValueRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the Mode Declaration used for the mode requests corresponding to this condition.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeValueRef用于引用特定的模块模式，它允许基础软件模块管理器(BswM)根据不同的模块模式来改变其行为或配置。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模块模式已在系统中定义且有效；BswMModeValueRef的使用需要遵循AUTOSAR的模块间通信规则；在配置时，应注意模式切换的实时性和一致性要求。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00864</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:46239dbf-b616-4d8e-be72-4e2f06f0c7df">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeRequestPort</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this container defines a mode request interface that is used to requests or indicate modes from/to the BswM. These interfaces are implemented as ports or as ordinary C-functions based upon if the request is made by an SW-C or a BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeRequestPort是AUTOSAR BSW模块管理（BswM）的配置参数，用于定义模式请求端口，这些端口允许BswM模块接收来自其他软件模块的模式切换请求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMModeRequestPort时，需要确保端口的定义与请求发送模块的模式声明一致；端口的模式请求类型应与BswM的逻辑执行路径相匹配；在配置过程中，应注意模式请求的优先级和处理策略，以避免模式切换冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">There are different types of mode requests:
                                                1. Mode requests from the SW-C:s
                                                2. Mode Requests from other BSW modules such as the DCM.
                                                3. State/mode indications from the RTE or other BSW modules such as the bus specific State Managers.

                                                Note that the BswM treats all request and indications in the exact same way.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00805</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a853591d-e671-4863-aa10-0082efe4dda1">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMRequestProcessing</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if the processing of the mode arbitration shall be done immediately when a mode request is received or if it shall be deferred to the processing of the main function of BswM.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00822</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_DEFERRED</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6adc035b-6adf-d81e-feef-5a9b76684fb7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_DEFERRED</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:1ccd5f4a-bff1-db40-eccc-9f8f0179c61f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_IMMEDIATE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:75026229-698c-4fbc-a905-6652e28355d6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMArbitrateOnInit</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines immediately arbitrate will be act in Init.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMArbitrateOnInit 用于定义基础软件模块在初始化阶段的仲裁策略，确保模块按照特定的顺序和条件进行初始化。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要根据系统的具体需求和依赖关系来设定；不正确的初始化顺序可能导致系统启动失败或运行不稳定；在多模块依赖的环境中，仲裁策略尤为重要以确保正确的初始化顺序。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN"> only available in immediately</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00960</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:dd5d5587-bfd1-4960-a654-bcbc222aca93">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeRequestSource</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This choice container specifies the source of the mode request or state/mode indication. The requester of a mode can be both SW-C:s and other BSW Modules, such as the bus specific State Managers.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeRequestSource配置项用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）中的模式请求源，它指定了哪些模块或实体可以向BswM发出模式切换的请求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMModeRequestSource时，需要确保每个请求源的标识符是唯一的；请求源应当明确对应到能够发出模式请求的实体；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于模式管理的配置要求严格，需要遵循标准文档中的规范进行配置。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00856</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a9fda01e-f3ad-46c3-affd-8a4e594a80e0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMBswModeNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a mode request source emanating from another BSW Module.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMBswModeNotification配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）如何被通知关于模式变化的信息，这允许BswM根据不同的模式改变其行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMBswModeNotification时，需要确保正确映射到相应的模块和模式，以便于BswM能够接收到正确的模式通知；此外，要注意模式通知的时序和条件，确保在系统的正确状态下通知BswM；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还需确保配置项符合标准中定义的属性和参数。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00926</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d1c204e5-6c8a-45e9-a191-7cc780db6f12">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMBswModeDeclarationGroupPrototypeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the Mode Declaration Group Prototype.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMBswModeDeclarationGroupPrototypeRef 是一个配置项，用于引用模式声明组原型，这通常用于定义基本软件模块的模式管理接口。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，确保引用的模式声明组原型在系统中是唯一的且已经定义；此配置项通常与BswM模块的模式管理功能紧密相关，因此需要与BswM模块的其他配置保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模式管理的规范来正确配置此项，以确保基本软件模块能够正确地进行模式切换。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00927</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION-GROUP-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fe496255-8d41-40bf-bfa5-0a27f5989c6d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMIcomIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication from CanSM of the configuration Id of the Icom configuration</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMIcomIndication是一个配置项，用于定义BswM（Basic Software Module）如何处理来自CanSM（CAN State Manager）的Icom（Interruptible Communication）状态指示。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMCanSMIcomIndication时，需要确保与CAN网络管理的需求相一致；此配置项应与具体的CAN网络和Icom配置相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的数据类型和结构来定义此配置项，以避免兼容性问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01018</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fc869a6c-8922-45d6-806a-efeddddff6c5">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMIcomIndicationSwitchError</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the type of indications (error or error-free) from the CanSM which this mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMIcomIndicationSwitchError 是一个配置项，用于定义当CAN通信状态管理（CanSM）的Icom（即隔离通信）指示发生切换错误时，BswM（基础软件模块管理器）应如何响应。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保BswM模块已经配置了相应的逻辑处理规则；此配置项的行为应与系统的故障管理策略一致；在配置过程中，应注意与其他通信管理模块的交互和依赖关系。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_ICOM_SWITCH_E_OK</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:35043d11-9fb9-8729-575e-5c32b1a318d7">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ICOM_SWITCH_E_FAILED</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:273411dd-29c7-90b6-56f1-22e4af45fdab">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ICOM_SWITCH_E_OK</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:26f0f697-d95c-4949-84a3-222fd5174bc5">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the CAN channel handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01019</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:60c83276-d2ab-4077-9e33-d59f361ac518">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of the current state of the CAN State Manager.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMIndication配置项用于定义CAN状态管理（CanSM）模块向BSW Mode Manager（BswM）报告网络模式变化的指示，允许BswM根据CAN网络的状态改变来调整ECU的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMCanSMIndication时，需要确保正确映射CanSM网络和BswM模式之间的关系；此配置项应与系统中实际的CAN网络数量和状态一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，BswM模块的配置应遵循最新的模块架构和API规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00857</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:45faeefb-4d0e-4a75-bac3-3fe76ff15822">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the CAN channel handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMChannelRef配置项用于定义BswM模块与CanSM通道之间的关联，这样BswM可以根据CanSM通道的状态来管理BswM的逻辑视图和行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保CanSM通道与BswM逻辑视图的正确映射；CanSM通道的状态变化应当能够触发BswM的规则评估；在多通道CAN网络中，每个CanSM通道应有其对应的BswMCanSMChannelRef配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00870</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
