                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:60c83276-d2ab-4077-9e33-d59f361ac581">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMNmStateChangeNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification from the Nm module that its state has changed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNmStateChangeNotification配置项用于定义网络管理状态机（Nm）在状态变化时，通知相应的Bsw模块（基础软件模块）的回调函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，需要确保回调函数与Nm状态机的状态变化正确对应；回调函数应当是可靠的，不会引起长时间的阻塞；在多个模块需要状态变化通知时，应考虑通知顺序和优先级。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:45faeefb-4d0e-4a75-bac3-3fe76ff15811">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMNmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the NM channel handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNmChannelRef配置项用于指定网络管理通信通道的引用，它将基本软件模块与特定的网络管理通道相关联。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMNmChannelRef时，需要确保引用的通道已在系统中定义并且与网络管理模块兼容；此配置项通常与网络管理模块的配置紧密相关，因此需要与网络配置保持一致；在多通道系统中，正确的通道引用对于网络管理功能的正确性至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01082</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
