                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:90275834-804e-460b-9d2b-0a066e5130ef">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification of the current operation mode of the ECU State Manager. This container does not contain any parameters since there are no further configuration needed for this type of request.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMIndication配置项用于定义ECU管理模块（EcuM）状态变化时的通知机制，允许软件组件根据ECU状态变化做出响应。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保正确配置通知机制以避免在ECU状态变化时错过重要事件；在设计系统时考虑ECU状态变化对系���行为的影响；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与EcuM模块的状态管理功能紧密集成。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00879</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2a6d2337-9140-4a6e-8625-d70ea66c17e7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMRUNRequestIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of the current State of the RUN Request Protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMRUNRequestIndication配置项用于定义ECU管理模块接收到远程唤醒请求时的指示，它是BswM模块与ECU管理需求之间的接口配置。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与ECU的低功耗模式和唤醒源配置相匹配，确保系统能够正确响应外部唤醒请求；在配置时需考虑ECU支持的唤醒源类型，以及与其他唤醒源的优先级关系；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用与ECU支持的功能和唤醒机制一致。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01043</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:85c4cff1-aeaf-42be-9919-196a9bd170f3">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMRUNRequestProtocolPort</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the EcuM State which is related to the mode request.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMRUNRequestProtocolPort是用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）与ECU管理运行控制（EcuM）之间的请求协议端口，用于处理运行管理请求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要确保与ECU的运行管理策略相匹配；在配置时需注意与其他BswM配置项的兼容性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确定义此配置项，需参考具体实现或供应商文档。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
