                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fedcd4b6-8179-4135-b1eb-0d4ed3702d3a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMWakeupSource</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification of the current state of an ECU State Manager wakeup source.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMWakeupSource 配置项用于定义车辆中用于唤醒电子控制单元（ECU）的唤醒源。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保唤醒源的配置与实际硬件和外部事件匹配；在系统休眠或低功耗模式下，正确管理唤醒源以避免不必要的功耗；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对唤醒源的管理和配置有详细规定，需要严格遵守。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00904</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:c11bd4c1-5ed5-4ed5-8d1d-4d1370aeef89">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMWakeupSrcRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the ECU State Manager Wakeup Source that the indication corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMWakeupSrcRef配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）中，ECU唤醒源的引用，这有助于BswM管理和响应不同的唤醒源事件。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保唤醒源与ECU支持的唤醒源相匹配；此配置项对于实现低功耗模式和唤醒策略至关重要；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对唤醒源的管理和配置有详细规定，需要遵循相关规范以保证系统的兼容性和可靠性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00905</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMCommonConfiguration/EcuMWakeupSource</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8bd59b7e-88d8-4e6b-a077-982f876f7712">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthIfPortGroupLinkStateChg</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication from the EthIf if the link state of a Ethernet interface switch port group has changed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthIfPortGroupLinkStateChg配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）中以太网接口端口组（EthIfPortGroup）的链路状态变化时的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，必须确保该配置项正确映射到相应的以太网接口端口组状态变化通知机制；此配置项通常与网络管理和诊断功能紧密相关，因此需要确保与这些功能的集成是正确的；在配置时，应注意与EthIf模块的配置一致性，避免配置不一致导致的功能异常。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01066</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5aaab5a2-0e23-456f-b47a-3eb72b1ba937">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the Ethernet Interface Switch Port Group that the indication corresponds to.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01067</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EthIf/EthIfConfigSet/EthIfSwitchPortGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c7a1a655-ad99-4506-8f61-328c655fc837">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthSMIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of the current state of the Ethernet State Manager.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthSMIndication配置项用于定义以太网状态管理指示，它指定了当以太网通信控制器状态发生变化时，应当通知哪个BswM模块的函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保正确配置以太网控制器与BswM模块之间的映射关系，以便于正确处理网络状态变化；在配置时需注意AUTOSAR版本兼容性，确保配置项属性与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准一致；此配置对于网络管理功能至关重要，错误的配置可能导致网络状态管理失效。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00860</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1276bcab-5dc0-4704-b50b-7b714bdcbf4a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthSMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the Ethernet channel handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthSMChannelRef 配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）与以太网状态管理（EthSM）之间的通道引用，确保网络管理功能的正确实现。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项必须确保引用的通道与实际的以太网通道配置相匹配；在配置过程中应避免重复或错误的通道引用；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保该配置项的正确性对网络管理的稳定性和可靠性至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00873</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:bacadd7e-ce13-40d0-bd5e-2a656b772fbd">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMFrSMIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of the current state of the FlexRay State Manager.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMFrSMIndication配置项用于定义BswM模块如何响应来自FlexRay通信堆栈管理（FrSM）模块的状态指示，以便根据FlexRay网络的当前状态调整BswM的内部管理逻辑。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保正确映射FlexRay通信状态到BswM的管理决策中，以避免网络状态误判；在配置时需考虑系统的实时性和网络的稳定性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于BswM模块与其他通信堆栈模块的交互提供了详细的指导，应遵循这些指导以确保兼容性和性能。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00858</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:58be722e-6d43-4ed1-b1f0-441da75ea1cc">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMFrSMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the  FlexRay Cluster handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMFrSMChannelRef配置项用于定义BswM模块与FlexRay通信状态管理模块（FrSM）之间的关联，指定BswM模块应当监控的FlexRay通道。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保引用的FlexRay通道与实际的FrSM通道一致；BswM模块的策略决策可能依赖于FrSM通道的状态，因此正确的关联至关重要；在多通道FlexRay系统中，每个通道都应有一个对应的BswMFrSMChannelRef配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00872</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:92e6a2bd-21cc-446c-abf1-172371d7a891">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMGenericRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This mode request originates from a requester that is not among the list of standardized mode requesters (i.e. the different resource managers).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMGenericRequest是一个配置项，用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）对于特定请求的处理，这些请求可能来自于应用层或其他基础软件模块。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMGenericRequest时，需要确保请求ID的唯一性，避免处理冲突；此配置项应与系统中的其他管理需求一起考虑，以确保整体的一致性和优先级管理；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，对于请求的处理可能涉及到复杂的逻辑，因此需要仔细设计以满足系统的实时性和可靠性要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00861</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:418ab994-a918-4944-ad81-e4720ddd8b56">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeRequesterId</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameters identifies the different users of the generic mode request interface.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeRequesterId用于唯一标识请求模式切换的软件模块，它是BswM（基础软件模块管理器）配置中的一个关键元素，用于管理和映射不同软件模块的模式请求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个BswMModeRequesterId在系统中是唯一的，以避���模式管理的冲突；在配置时需考虑模式请求的优先级，以确保系统的稳定性和预期行为；BswM配置应与系统中所有模式请求者的实际需求相匹配，以确保正确的模式切换逻辑。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00874</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b7577d87-a155-4779-ab77-d96e58f3a63f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmBroadcastStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a notification of the desired broadcast status per network, triggered via DM13.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939DcmBroadcastStatus配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（DCM）在J1939网络上广播状态信息的行为和条件，确保符合J1939协议的要求。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要根据J1939网络的具体要求进行详细配置，包括但不限于广播的周期、条件和优先级；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保配置与网络管理和诊断需求一致；特别注意广播消息的安全性和隐私保护措施，避免敏感信息泄露。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00985</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:17cb344f-9533-47a8-939d-32a969f96335">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the communication channel which is affected by this mode request.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00988</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c93b165a-068d-414c-a336-8809b579f4e7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939NmIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is an indication of the current state of the J1939 network management module.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939NmIndication是一个配置项，用于定义基础软件模块J1939网络管理（Nm）的指示回调函数，该函数在网络管理状态发生变化时被调用。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939NmIndication时，需要确保回调函数符合AUTOSAR标准中定义的接口规范；此配置项通常由网络管理模块的开发者提供，应确保其与系统中其他网络管理功能的兼容性；在实际应用中，需要注意该指示的执行时间和资源消耗，以免影响系统性能。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00966</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e8000929-cad7-4207-9eb4-6c1787ae04a0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939NmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the J1939Nm channel handle that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939NmChannelRef 配置项用于指定某个J1939网络管理模块（Nm）所使用的CAN通道引用，确保网络管理功能能够正确地与特定的通信通道关联。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的CAN通道已经在系统中定义并正确初始化；J1939网络管理模块与CAN通道的关联必须一一对应，不能出现多个Nm模块引用同一CAN通道的情况；在多通道系统中，正确的通道引用对于网络管理的分区和隔离至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00967</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:66e931f8-178f-4bf1-ae18-c1cdf8c9c92a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939NmNodeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the node that the mode request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939NmNodeRef 是一个配置参数，用于将基本软件模块中的J1939网络管理节点引用到具体的网络管理配置。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939NmNodeRef时，需要确保引用的节点与实际的网络拓扑和节点地址设置相匹配；此配置项应与J1939堆栈的其他部分协同工作，以确保网络管理功能的正确实现；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的网络管理规范来配置此项，以保证与标准的兼容性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00997</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
