                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2452616b-0819-4fa3-9a20-28c9fd64b6fe">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMNvMJobModeIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Indicates the current status of the multiblock job. The job is identified via BswMNvmService. Possible values for this indication are the possible values of NvM_RequestResultType.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNvMJobModeIndication配置项用于指定NvM（非易失性内存管理模块）作业的模式指示，它允许基础软件模块（BswM）根据NvM作业的结果来更新其内部管理逻辑。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保NvM和BswM之间的接口和数据交互正确配置，以便BswM可以准确地根据NvM作业的状态改变其行为；此配置项的使用应与系统的诊断和监控需求相一致；在配置过程中，应注意避免与其他模块的作业指示配置冲突。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00956</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ac4b5a2a-a386-4bb4-b7b8-58a5baaefe2c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMNvmService</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the Nvm job which is related to the mode request.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNvmService 配置项定义了基本软件模块（BswM）与非易失性存储管理（NvM）服务之间的交互，用于控制和监视NvM请求的处理。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保BswMNvmService配置正确反映了BswM模块与NvM服务之间的依赖关系；配置时需注意BswM模块的版本与NvM服务的版本兼容性；在配置BswMNvmService时，应遵循项目特定的需求和指导，以确保系统的正确性和稳定性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00957</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>NvmReadAll</DEFAULT-VALUE>
