                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e2e5f6f-6b37-4408-8b4b-fb66169315d4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMNvMRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Via this Mode Request Source the NvM indicates the current status of the specified block. Possible Values are:</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNvMRequest配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）与非易失性内存管理模块（NvM）之间的请求关系，包括请求的类型和目标，以便于控制和管理非易失性数据的读写操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMNvMRequest时，需要确保请求类型与目标NvM块的兼容性；对于每个请求，必须明确指定请求的触发条件和执行动作；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于NvM请求的处理流程和状态管理有明确规定，需要遵守这些规定以保证系统的稳定性和数据的一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">NvM_RequestResultType
                                                                NVM_REQ_OK
                                                                NVM_REQ_NOT_OK
                                                                NVM_REQ_PENDING
                                                                NVM_REQ_INTEGRITY_FAILED
                                                                NVM_REQ_BLOCK_SKIPPED
                                                                NVM_REQ_NV_INVALIDATED
                                                                NVM_REQ_CANCELED
                                                                NVM_REQ_REDUNDANCY_FAILED
                                                                NVM_REQ_RESTORED_FROM_ROM</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00890</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:63b81990-3e16-437b-84f5-08451acf7709">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMNvMBlockRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the NvM Block Descriptor that the request corresponds to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNvMBlockRef配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）与非易失性存储管理模块（NvM）之间的关联，指定BswM应当如何参考NvM中的数据块。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMNvMBlockRef时，需要确保引用的NvM块ID是存在且有效的；此外，应当注意BswM和NvM之间的数据一致性和同步机制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的属性应与标准定义的数据类型和结构相匹配。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00891</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/NvM/NvMBlockDescriptor</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:50aef4e4-a2d3-4889-8919-426c680c9a2b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdClientServiceCurrentState</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Used by Service Discovery module to indicate current state of the Client Service (available/down).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdClientServiceCurrentState配置项用于定义基于服务发现的客户端服务的当前状态，包括服务是否可用以及其它相关状态信息。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保服务发现机制已正确配置并且处于激活状态；状态更新应及时反映服务的实际可用性；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中未明确定义，因此具体实现可能依赖于供应商的实现细节。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
