                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Sd/SdConfig/SdInstance/SdServerService/SdEventHandler</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2f25796e-4212-4187-a4fd-5cae123930de">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwcModeNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a mode switch notification associated with a RTE switch interface.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwcModeNotification配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）与应用软件组件（Swc）之间的模式切换通知机制，确保系统在不同模式下能够正确响应和执行相应的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保模式切换的通知路径和条件清晰定义，避免因配置不当导致系统响应不及时或错误；此配置项对系统的实时性和可靠性有较大影响，需谨慎处理；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对模式管理和通知机制有详细规定，需确保配置符合标准要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00892</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5aa3f84f-623b-4f8a-846d-b0f2f8506bd5">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwcModeNotificationModeDeclarationGroupPrototypeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the ModeDeclarationGroupPrototype.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwcModeNotificationModeDeclarationGroupPrototypeRef 配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）通知软件组件（Swc）关于模式声明组的引用，这样软件组件可以根据模式变化做出响应。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，确保引用的模式声明组在系统中是存在且有效的；此配置项通常与BswM模式管理逻辑紧密相关，需要与系统设计师协作以确保正确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循模式管理的规范来配置此项，以保证模式通知机制的正确实现。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00893</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION-GROUP-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cec88478-df6b-44b1-9036-edb5f3e101eb">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwcModeRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">The source of the mode request is a SW Component.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwcModeRequest配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）与软件组件（Swc）之间的模式请求关系，确保系统中不同软件组件的模式切换请求能够被基础软件模块正确处理和响应。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保模式请求的唯一性和一���性，避免不同软件组件对同一模式的重复请求；此配置项对于系统的模式管理和控制至关重要，需谨慎定义；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于模式管理的机制和接口有明确规定，需确保配置项符合这些规定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00862</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a60f6cc3-b6f2-4c9c-9a3c-e956264d7dee">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwcModeRequestVariableDataPrototypeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the VariableDataPrototype.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwcModeRequestVariableDataPrototypeRef 配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中用于请求模式变更的软件组件（Swc）的变量原型引用。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保引用的变量原型与请求的模式声明一致；变量原型应当是定义在相应软件组件中的模式请求接口的一部分；正确配置此项对于模式管理逻辑的正确实现至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01046</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c8e2725a-6abd-469e-8c4b-0b840ca34412">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is a timer which can be used for time dependent rules.  This mode request port can be in one of three modes (depending on the state of the timer):</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTimer是一个配置项，用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）中的定时器，它控制BswM逻辑的执行频率和定时行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTimer时，需要确保定时器的时间参数与系统的时钟和调度策略相匹配；定时器的精度和分辨率应满足应用需求；在多核或分布式系统中，还需考虑定时器同步和一致性问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">* BSWM_TIMER_STOPPED  (intial)  (The timer has been stopped by an action)
                                                                * BSWM_TIMER_STARTED  (The timer has been started by an action)
                                                                * BSWM_TIMER_EXPIRED  (The timer has expired)</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01058</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:92e6a2bd-21cc-446c-abf1-172371d7a198">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMUserConditionRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This mode request originates from a user defined function.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMUserConditionRequest是一个配置项，用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）中用户条件的请求，这些请求会影响BswM的决策和行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMUserConditionRequest时，需要确保其与BswM的逻辑表达式和规则相匹配；用户条件请求的标识符必须在整个系统中唯一；在实际应用中，应当注意这些用户条件请求可能会受到外部因素的影响，因此需要仔细管理和测试以确保系统的稳定性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00861</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:418ab994-a918-4944-ad81-e4720ddd8b65">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>User Condition</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameters identifies the different functions defined by users.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：User Condition是一个配置项，用于定义AUTOSAR软件组件（SW-C）或交互层（Service Layer）中的条件表达式，这些条件表达式通常用于决定某个功能是否执行。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置User Condition时，需要确保表达式的逻辑正确性和一致性；应当遵循AUTOSAR的数据类型和操作符规范；在多条件表达式中，注意优先级和括号的使用，以避免逻辑错误。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00874</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a780195c-9698-494b-810e-d6f1b56cef30">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeInitValue</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the initial mode value that is used by BswM for the corresponding mode request after initialization. The initial mode value is defined by configuring either BswMBswModeInitValue or BswMCompuScaleModeValue. This container is optional.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeInitValue配置项用于定义BSW Mode Manager（BswM）模块在系统启动时的初始模式值，这个值将作为系统启动后模块的默认行为状态。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMModeInitValue时，需要确保初始模式值与系统设计和需求相匹配；初始模式值应该与BswM的模式声明一致，避免配置了一个未声明的模式；在系统复位或启动时，BswM将使用这个初始值来初始化模式管理逻辑，因此需要谨慎配置以避免系统启动时的行为异常。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00928</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ce82e9c7-09eb-4a12-8e46-aaa2333a3fb7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMBswModeInitValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the initial mode value that is used by BswM for the corresponding mode request after initialization.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMBswModeInitValue配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）在系统启动时的初始模式。这个配置确保了在系统启动时，各个模块能够以一种预定义的模式开始运行。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMBswModeInitValue时，需要确保初始模式与模块的设计和依赖关系相匹配；此外，应当注意该初始模式值是否符合AUTOSAR标准中对于模式管理的规定；在多模式系统中，还需考虑模式切换的一致性和依赖关系。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00932</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                  </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:445b3f16-9e5b-8a33-0f5e-1c736dc0c69f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuScaleModeValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains parameters used to define a mode value.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCompuScaleModeValue是AUTOSAR BSW模块配置中的一个参数，用于定义基础软件模块管理（BswM）中的计算尺度模式值，这通常与诊断、网络管理等功能相关联，用于控制或调整模块的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMCompuScaleModeValue时，需要确保其值与相关模块的期望行为相匹配；此外，该值通常应与系统中其他模块或组件的配置保持一致，以确保整个系统的协同工作；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果该属性的使用或取值范围有所变化，需要参考最新的标准文档进行配置。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:14cad0f2-a2a5-d832-b10a-0522c4790db0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuConstText</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">The value of this parameter shall match the VT member of a CompuConst defined within the referenced CompuMethod (BswMCompuMethodRef). The interval value of the corresponding CompuScale shall be used as the mode request value.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCompuConstText是一个配置参数，用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）中的计算方法常量文本，这些文本常用于与人机界面（HMI）之间的数据交换。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，所有的配置参数都应当遵循标准的数据定义和格式；BswMCompuConstText的值应当与系统中使用的语言和编码标准一致；在配置时，应确保文本字符串与预期的计算方法常量匹配，避免因为文本错误导致的功能异常。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01041</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:275872d9-27f8-ce2d-b997-791a215625b4">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCompuMethodRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the CompuMethod used for mode requests.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCompuMethodRef是一个配置项，用于引用一个CompuMethod，该CompuMethod定义了基础软件模块管理（BswM）模块中使用的数据转换方法。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保引用的CompuMethod与BswM模块的数据处理需求相匹配；CompuMethod应已在系统中定义且有效；在BswM模块配置中正确设置BswMCompuMethodRef以确保数据转换的正确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>COMPU-METHOD</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9711550f-8c6a-4c9d-a1bd-b6d3828a9ce5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMRule</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this container describes a BswM arbitration rule. The rule either consists of a simple mode condition or a more complex logical expression. This container also references the action lists that shall be invoked when the rule is evaluated to True or False.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRule是用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）的逻辑规则，这些规则根据输入的模式请求来控制BswM的行为，从而管理ECU内部的软件模块和通信。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRule时，需要确保规则的唯一性和一致性，避免相互冲突；规则的设计应考虑到系统的实时性和资源限制；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对BswM的配置和实现提供了详细指导，确保遵循这些指导以保证系统的兼容性和性能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00806</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:75ab5231-5ebb-4aec-a088-bc956ba35023">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMNestedExecutionOnly</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines for its related Rule if the Rule is an Independent rule or a Subordinate rule;</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNestedExecutionOnly 配置项用于指定基础软件模块（BswM）是否仅在嵌套执行上下文中被调用。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项确保BswM的调用模式与系统设计的预期一致；不正确的配置可能导致系统行为不符合预期；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，此配置项应仔细管理以避免执行时的冲突或错误。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">false: an Independent rule, i.e. to be evaluated each time applicable (both as standalone Rule driven by its own BswMModeRequestSource and when referenced by another Rule).

                                                        true: a Subordinated rule, to be evaluated ONLY as a result of being referenced in one or more Action Lists.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00935</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:42592c03-2e60-4cb0-8357-5a711cba0547">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMRuleInitState</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is a part of the reset/initialization behavior of BswM.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRuleInitState 配置项定义了基本软件模块管理（BswM）规则的初始状态，这是BswM启动时评估规则所依据的状态。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRuleInitState时，需要确保初始状态与系统的启动行为一致；不正确的初始状态可能导致系统在启动时采取错误的行为；此配置项应与BswM的逻辑和依赖关系紧密结合，以确保系统的正确初始化。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Action lists are executed when the result of a rule evaluation have changed since the last evaluation. This parameter defines the &quot;previous evaluation result&quot; of a rule to be used after initialization of the BswM.

                                                        If this parameter is set to BSWM_UNDEFINED, the evaluation result is always treated as changed at the first evaluation of the rule after initialization.

                                                        If this parameter is set to BSWM_TRUE, the evaluation result is treated as changed if the rule is evaluated to false.

                                                        If this parameter is set to BSWM_FALSE, the evaluation result is treated as changed if the rule is evaluated to true.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00888</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
