                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f9b55d8-de62-4333-96a5-061519c7ffc1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeControl</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all configuration sub-containers and parameters related to the mode control functionality of the BswM.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeControl是AUTOSAR BSW模块管理（BswM）的配置参数，用于定义模式控制接口，这些接口允许BswM模块根据系统或网络的不同模式来控制BSW模块的行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMModeControl时，需要确保其模式请求和模式切换逻辑与系统设计和需求相匹配；此外，应注意模式控制接口的实现必须满足实时性要求；在多模式系统中，还需考虑模式之间的依赖关系和切换策略。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00802</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:add00e45-e97c-4d9a-8208-befcbfbfd3e1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMAction</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each container of this type defines an action. These actions can be part of one or several action lists.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMAction配置项定义了基本软件模块管理（BswM）中的动作，这些动作是在满足特定条件时由BswM触发的，用于控制和管理基础软件模块及其通信。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMAction时，需要确保动作的定义与系统需求相匹配，避免配置错误导致系统行为不符预期；BswMAction的触发条件需明确，以确保系统的可靠性和稳定性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对BswMAction的属性和行为有详细规定，需遵循这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00810</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cc9ad948-01ce-4ed4-a898-41fcd6ede588">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMAvailableActions</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Choice container including the available actions to be used in the action lists.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMAvailableActions配置项定义了基本软件模块（BswM）可以执行的动作列表，这些动作根据系统状态或事件进行触发，以实现系统的模式管理和控制逻辑。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：动作类型必须与BswM的模式管理逻辑一致，确保配置的动作可由BswM管理；动作定义需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对BswMAvailableActions的规范；在定义动作时，考虑系统的实时性和资源限制，避免配置过于复杂的动作导致系统性能下降。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00826</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:86f037c0-4c28-41b3-9e57-324e1b673aec">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMClearEventRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains a reference to a BswMEventRequestPort which will be cleared (i.e. set to CLEAR state) when this action is executed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMClearEventRequest 用于清除在基本软件模块中设置的事件，这有助于管理事件触发的任务和中断。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保正确的事件标识符与对应的模块关联，避免错误清除可能导致系统行为不可预测；此配置项应与BswMEvent配置保持一致，确保系统的稳定性和可靠性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01054</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8037fbdf-ebd5-4951-b6c9-31dcdedbe287">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMClearEventRequestPortRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references the BswMEventRequestPort which will be cleared.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMClearEventRequestPortRef配置项用于指定基础软件模块（BswM）清除特定事件请求的端口引用，以便于BswM管理和控制事件状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的端口正确对应于需要清除事件请求的事件；在配置时需注意与BswM的其他配置项的一致性和兼容性；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应确保与BswM的事件管理机制兼容。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01055</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMEventRequestPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0ce4c9d3-b52a-4bf4-8268-aebdfac80f52">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMAllowCom</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters for the action to allow or to block communication for a ComM Channel. ComM_CommunicationAllowed  is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMAllowCom 配置项用于管理通信管理器（ComM）的通信授权，允许或禁止网络通信。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该配置与车辆的网络管理策略一致；在实施时应考虑系统的安全性和隐私要求；该配置项应与其他BswM模式管理配置项协同工作，以确保系统行为的一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00909</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a75f55aa-9e34-48e5-9c33-8e121ac7f7d8">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComAllowed</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">The parameter BswMComMAllowChannelRef refers to a channel which will allow or block communication using the function ComM_CommunicationAllowed().</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComAllowed 是一个配置参数，用于控制基本软件模块管理（BswM）对通信管理模块（ComM）的控制权限，允许或禁止通信。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComAllowed时，需要确保它与系统的通信需求相匹配；此配置项对系统的通信管理有直接影响，因此应谨慎处理；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应检查此配置项的属性是否与标准定义的数据类型和使用约束一致。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter corresponds to the parameter &quot;Allowed&quot; of the function ComM_CommunicationAllowed().</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00918</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cfa3f8ee-4192-4364-a046-f5ef39f8626f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMAllowChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the ComM Channel for which communication shall be allowed or blocked.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMAllowChannelRef是一个配置参数，用于将BswM模块中的通信管理逻辑与特定的ComM通道相关联，从而允许BswM根据ComM通道的状态改变来执行相应的管理逻辑。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMAllowChannelRef时，必须确保引用的ComM��道已经在系统中定义并且有效；此配置项的正确性对于BswM模块能否正确响应ComM通道状态变化至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间的接口和数据交换规范来配置此参数。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;Channel&quot; of the function ComM_CommunicationAllowed().</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00912</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:93ede02b-24af-4c08-a0ef-1e3a636fbbcc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMModeLimitation</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a limitation of communication mode for a ComM Channel. ComM_LimitChannelToNoComMode is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMModeLimitation配置项用于定义车辆通信管理器（ComM）的模式限制，这些限制由基础软件模块管理器（BswM）根据车辆的不同状态来控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMModeLimitation时，需要确保它与系统中其他BswM配置项的依赖关系和优先级设置相协调；此外，应当考虑到不同ECU上的ComM模式限制可能会有所不同，因此需要根据具体的应用场景进行配置；最后，要确保配置的模式限制符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于BswM模块的要求和规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00908</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a90697cd-02ca-46c7-b4d9-3561ac126656">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMLimitMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">The function ComM_LimitChannelToNoComMode() takes in this boolean parameter to limit the channel's com mode to no-com mode.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMLimitMode配置项用于定义通信管理模块（ComM）在网络管理策略中的限制模式，控制网络通信资源的使用，以满足不同的网络带宽和能耗要求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMLimitMode时，需要确保其设置与系统的网络管理策略一致；此配置项对系统的通信效率和资源使用有直接影响，需谨慎设置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于网络管理的配置和策略提供了详细的指导，建议仔细阅读相关章节以确保配置的正确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter corresponds to the parameter &quot;Status&quot; of the function ComM_LimitChannelToNoComMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00910</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:dfb83a13-105c-4ad9-b65d-8465bcad8ddd">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMLimitChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the ComM channel for which the communication mode should be limited.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMLimitChannelRef 配置项用于引用通信管理器（ComM）中定义的通道限制，这样BSW管理器（BswM）可以根据这些限制来管理BSW模块的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMLimitChannelRef时，需要确保引用的ComM通道确实存在且已被定义；此外，BswM模块的配置应与ComM模块的配置保持一致，以确保通信管理的正确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，任何对BswMComMLimitChannelRef的修改都应当通过标准的配置工具来进行，以避免手动错误。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;Channel&quot; of the function ComM_LimitChannelToNoComMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00911</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5c07eb69-9db2-4f5c-8e08-36329bcf4dc9">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMModeSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a switch of communication mode for a ComM User. ComM_RequestComMode is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMModeSwitch 配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理器（BswM）如何根据通信管理器（ComM）的模式变化来切换其管理的不同模式。这允许BswM根据网络管理需求来控制ECU内部的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，需要确保BswM模块能够正确识别和响应ComM模式变化的通知；BswM的模式切换逻辑应与系统的通信需求和依赖关系相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模式管理接口和通信协议规范来实现此配置项。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00831</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a8479736-a047-4a2e-a9de-9de9d1fe5e26">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMRequestedMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the requested communication mode.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMRequestedMode 是一个配置参数，用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）如何根据通信管理器（ComM）的状态请求来控制网络管理器（Nm）的状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMRequestedMode时，需要确保其值与ComM和Nm模块的状态机和模式切换逻辑相匹配；此配置项的设置应考虑系统的通信需求和节能策略；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间接口定义和模式管理规范，以确保正确的模式转换和系统行为。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter corresponds to the parameter &quot;ComMode&quot; of the function ComM_RequestComMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00840</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_COMM_FULL_COMMUNICATION</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:54904522-2557-9e0a-302a-67c0b9d5a6bc">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_COMM_FULL_COMMUNICATION</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:06fa79b9-8643-97c4-34d7-2b8f7a7ec203">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_COMM_NO_COMMUNICATION</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:38ab9166-a9b6-4666-8064-b0fe9192d7af">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMUserRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the ComM User that is associated to the Communication channel for which the communication mode should be requested.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMUserRef 是一个配置项，用于在BswM（基础软件模块管理器）中引用ComM（通信管理器）用户，以便BswM可以根据ComM用户的状态来管理和调整基础软件模块的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMComMUserRef时，需要确保引用的ComM用户已经在系统中定义；BswM模块需要正确处理ComM用户状态的变化，以便实现预期的管理逻辑；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的引用机制和数据类型，以符合标准规范。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;User&quot; of the function ComM_RequestComMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00841</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMUser</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1e8e1095-9175-4018-a20f-7bda9c329f7e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMCoreHaltMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a switch of the activation state of core Halt.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCoreHaltMode 配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）在系统核心（Core）发生故障时的行为模式，通常涉及到系统的安全停机策略。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMCoreHaltMode时，需要确保该行为与系统的安全需求和故障管理策略相符合；此配置项的设置必须考虑到所有相关核心的故障处理机制；在多核系统中，还需注意核间的故障传播和处理一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00970</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e087c8f3-aa1e-40c6-a47b-e85f4cc25cdf">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCoreHaltActivationState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Different possibilities are offered depending on the OS implementation and the CPU HW. The HALT modes addressed by this parameter are defined as names (strings) in the OS implementation. Different implementation may implement different HALT modes and subsequently different names.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCoreHaltActivationState配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）在系统核心（Core）停止或挂起时的激活状态，控制系统在特定条件下的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该状态与系统的安全需求相匹配；不同的硬件平台可能会对此配置项的支持有所不同，需仔细检查硬件兼容性；在多核系统中，每个核心的配置可能需要独立设置，以确保系统的稳定性和安全性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00972</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ea40948e-6812-4731-b943-9a84dd5b1ade">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMTargetCoreRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the core on which the Core Halt process must be influenced.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTargetCoreRef 配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）应当运行在哪一个处理器核心上，这有助于实现多核处理器上的软件分配和优化。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在多核系统设计中，必须确保BswMTargetCoreRef正确指向期望的核心，以避免资源竞争和性能问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求对多核支持进行明确的配置，因此该属性应与系统设计和分区策略相一致；在配置时还需考虑与其他模块的依赖关系和核心间通信机制。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00971</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucHardware/EcucCoreDefinition</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:22778ab5-dd84-4876-b8f8-3baced96702a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMDeadlineMonitoringControl</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to enabling and disabling of deadline monitoring for one or several PDUs in COM.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMDeadlineMonitoringControl配置项用于控制基本软件模块（BswM）中的截止时间监控功能，允许开启或关闭特定模块或组件的截止时间监控。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在系统设计阶段明确哪些组件需要截止时间监控，以避免不必要的性能开销；配置时需考虑系统的实时性要求和资源限制；不正确的配置可能导致系统运行不稳定或不满足实时性要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00830</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:858f665d-7fc6-49e4-a22a-b512c6e0b69b">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMDisabledDMPduGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a PDU Group for which the Deadline Monitoring should be disabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMDisabledDMPduGroupRef 配置项用于引用在BswM模块中被禁用的诊断消息PDU组。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMDisabledDMPduGroupRef时，必须确保引用的PDU组在系统中存在且有效；此配置项通常与诊断通信管理相关，确保正确配置以避免诊断通信问题；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间的依赖关系和初始化顺序，以保证系统的稳定性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;IpduGroupId&quot; of the function Com_DisableReceptionDM.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00852</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Com/ComConfig/ComIPduGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:489675a3-4dfa-43b5-8f8e-48609a142a1d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEnabledDMPduGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a PDU Group for which the Deadline Monitoring should be enabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEnabledDMPduGroupRef是一个配置项，用于引用使能诊断通信的PDU组，这样BswM（Basis Software Module）可以管理这些PDU组的使能状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEnabledDMPduGroupRef时，需要确保引用的PDU组在系统中已定义且有效；此配置项通常与诊断通信管理相关，因此需要与DiagComM或相应的诊断管理模块协调；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用符合BswM模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;IpduGroupId&quot; of the function Com_EnableReceptionDM.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00851</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Com/ComConfig/ComIPduGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:584f5166-61ed-409a-81cd-bad39efcbb9c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMDriverInitListBswM</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the action to trigger an EcuM driver initialization list.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMDriverInitListBswM 配置项用于定义ECU管理模块（BswM）在系统启动时初始化驱动程序的顺序和列表。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保初始化顺序符合系统依赖性和启动策略要求；不正确的驱动初始化顺序可能导致系统启动失败或运行不稳定；该配置应与硬件抽象层和其他底层管理模块的配置保持一致。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01064</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ec0b5fc8-d888-4936-89df-778851797d73">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMDriverInitListBswMRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the EcuM EcuMDriverInitListBswM container which represents the driver init list to be triggered.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMDriverInitListBswMRef 配置项用于指定在ECU管理模块初始化期间需要调用的BswM模块的驱动初始化列表。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，需要确保引用的BswM驱动初始化列表与实际的BswM配置相匹配；此配置项通常由工具自动生成，手动修改时应谨慎以避免初始化顺序错误；在多驱动系统中，正确的初始化顺序对系统稳定性和启动时间至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01065</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMFlexConfiguration/EcuMDriverInitListBswM</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:88eb34f2-e877-4fd8-8ecb-b5f8ee97123d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMGoDownHaltPoll</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the action to trigger the EcuM_GoDownHaltPoll from BswM.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMGoDownHaltPoll是一个配置项，用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）在ECU管理器（EcuM）状态机中GoDown状态的轮询行为，以便在系统需要关闭时进行必要的轮询检查。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置项与ECU的低功耗管理策略相匹配；正确配置此项以避免在系统关闭过程中的不必要延迟；此配置项的使用应结合具体的硬件和系统需求来考虑，以确保系统的快速且安全的关闭。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00963</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5bf3393d-903b-435c-822a-e8df76b79337">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMUserIdRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a EcuM UserId.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMUserIdRef是一个配置项，用于将基本软件模块（BswM）的用户定义的标识符与ECU管理模块（EcuM）中定义的用户标识符进行关联，以便在系统启动或运行时进行相应的模式管理和控制。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保BswMEcuMUserIdRef正确映射到EcuM定义的用户标识符，避免配置错误导致系统行为不符合预期；该配置项的使用需要根据实际的系统需求和设计来决定，不是所有系统都需要配置此项；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，对于用户标识符的定义和使用有明确的规范，需要仔细遵守以保证系统的兼容性和可维护性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00964</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMFlexConfiguration/EcuMFlexUserConfig</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:20f34f5e-3ff3-4e97-8120-ed86c17c2351">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMSelectShutdownTarget</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the shutdown target.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMSelectShutdownTarget配置项用于定义ECU管理模块（EcuM）在系统请求关闭时选择的关机目标状态，这决定了系统在关闭过程中将要进入的具体低功耗或关机状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保所选的关机目标状态与系统的低功耗需求和硬件支持相匹配；不同的关机目标可能需要不同的唤醒源配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置与EcuM的状态管理和唤醒逻辑兼容。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00961</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1674cd2c-0b6a-4bac-9052-256ebd42eadb">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMShutdownTarget</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the shutdown target that the BswM selects at the EcuM.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMShutdownTarget配置项定义了ECU管理模块（EcuM）在系统关闭过程中应达到的目标状态，这有助于确保系统按照预定的顺序安全地关闭。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEcuMShutdownTarget时，必须确保所选目标状态与系统的安全需求和功耗需求相匹配；此配置项在系统设计阶段需要特别注意，以避免在实际操作中引发系统不稳定；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于关闭目标的定义可能与早期版本有所不同，需要根据最新标准进行配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00993</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_ECUM_SHUTDOWN_TARGET_OFF</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:cfa605bc-0c59-9dae-1f30-d9810f2715cb">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ECUM_SHUTDOWN_TARGET_OFF</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2caee945-efbe-9cd1-3dcf-6ad92dc54591">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ECUM_SHUTDOWN_TARGET_RESET</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:199ff193-d8b3-9188-1db9-955217dc6990">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ECUM_SHUTDOWN_TARGET_SLEEP</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8587bf9a-a8cb-4f72-9918-45403d89e83f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEcuMResetModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a reset mode.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEcuMResetModeRef配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中ECU管理模块（EcuM）定义的重置模式引用，以便在特定条件下控制ECU的重置行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的EcuM重置模式与实际的系统重置策略相匹配；在配置时需注意与其他模块的依赖关系和交互；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与EcuM模块的定义严格一致，避免不一致导致的系统行为异常。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00994</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
