                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ef23822a-de2d-4e8b-85ae-ece88aced504">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthIfSwitchPortGroupRequestMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to requesting a mode for the EthIfSwtPortGroup.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthIfSwitchPortGroupRequestMode配置项用于定义以太网交换机端口组的请求模式，这涉及到网络管理和端口组状态的控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，网络管理配置需要符合通信堆栈的要求；确保端口组请求模式与实际硬件和网络管理策略相匹配；在配置时应参考相关的以太网驱动模块和网络管理模块的规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The EthIf_SwitchPortGroupRequestMode API is called when this action is executed.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01068</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a1b265f1-9408-4c9d-a023-85891c65e93e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthTrcvMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the mode which will be requested.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthTrcvMode配置项定义了基本软件模块（BswM）中以太网收发器（EthTrcv）的模式管理，用于控制以太网收发器的不同操作模式。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMEthTrcvMode时，需要确保模式与以太网收发器支持的实际模式相匹配；此外，应当注意BswM模块与EthTrcv模块之间的接口匹配和通信协议一致性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关规范来配置模式管理，以确保系统的稳定性和可靠性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_ETHTRCV_MODE_ACTIVE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:c5c1a04c-f380-9421-32d9-1189455f69a0">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ETHTRCV_MODE_ACTIVE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:d235b9f9-80db-9b2c-05d7-dd6cd3fa9ae5">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_ETHTRCV_MODE_DOWN</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:58791729-3dec-4b65-b8f4-77e937fb71d7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the Ethernet Interface Switch Port Group which will receive the request.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef 配置项用于引用以太网交换机端口组，它定义了基本软件模块以太网接口（BswMEthIf）与特定交换机端口组之间的关联。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的交换机端口组在系统中存在且有效；此配置项对于实现网络管理和以太网交换功能至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关网络配置规范，确保配置的一致性和正确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01069</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EthIf/EthIfConfigSet/EthIfSwitchPortGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:54c633ca-521b-4b99-b3cd-c5fbee8ceacc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMFrSMAllSlots</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameter(s) for the action to request an exit from Flexray KeySlotOnlyMode.  FrSM_AllSlots is called when this action is executed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMFrSMAllSlots配置项用于定义BswM模块如何管理FlexRay通信控制器的状态机，特别是在所有槽位（Slots）中的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMFrSMAllSlots时，需要确保与FlexRay网络的实际配置和需求相匹配；此配置项对于确保网络的稳定性和性能至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于FlexRay通信的管理有详细规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01037</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:fc0697f3-26e1-4058-91b5-73e45a3f60f9">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMFrSMAllSlotsNetworkHandleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This references the FlexRay cluster.  The reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;NetworkHandle&quot; of the function FrSM_AllSlots.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMFrSMAllSlotsNetworkHandleRef配置项用于指定某个FlexRay网络通信控制器的网络句柄引用，以便BswM（基础软件模块管理器）可以管理和监视所有FlexRay通信槽的状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要确保正确引用FlexRay网络控制器的唯一标识符；在配置时需注意与实际硬件和网络拓扑的一致性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于FlexRay网络管理的配置要求严格，确保配置的准确性对系统的稳定性和性能至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01038</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3431b5b8-308c-4994-90c8-7fdec9b29608">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmStateSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a switch of the J1939 Diagnostic Communication Managers network state for a J1939 node. J1939Dcm_SetState is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939DcmStateSwitch 配置项用于定义基于J1939协议的诊断控制模块（DCM）在不同状态下的行为和状态转换。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项必须确保与车辆的J1939协议和诊断需求相匹配；状态转换逻辑应清晰，避免在实际应用中造成状态机错误；在配置时应考虑系统的安全和诊断策略。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dd7e6df6-abe5-4128-b83f-49f403604f91">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmRequestedState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the communication state of the J1939 Diagnostic Communication Manager and corresponds to the parameter &quot;newState&quot; of the function J1939Dcm_SetState.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939DcmRequestedState 配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（DCM）在J1939网络上请求的状态，这通常涉及到控制单元之间的诊断会话控制。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939DcmRequestedState时，需要确保它与所使用的J1939诊断协议栈兼容，并且符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断会话控制的规定；此外，应当注意该配置项对于网络管理和诊断服务的影响，确保它不会与其他网络参与者的状态请求发生冲突；最后，由于J1939是基于CAN总线的协议，还应考虑到网络带宽和优先级分配等因素。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01035</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_J1939DCM_STATE_OFFLINE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4d497959-a477-95e2-1e87-1921c6c08c0d">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_J1939DCM_STATE_OFFLINE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:63b82e46-4d44-957e-4f5b-62306e4edbc3">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_J1939DCM_STATE_ONLINE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f7d9d272-1c67-4ddb-80ee-7d35313bfa51">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to the unique channel defined by the ComMChannel and provides access to the unique channel index value in ComMChannelId.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939DcmChannelRef配置项用于指定诊断通信管理器（DCM）模块中J1939通道的引用，确保DCM能够正确地与J1939网络上的节点进行通信。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939DcmChannelRef时，需要确保引用的J1939通道已在系统中定义并正确配置；此配置项必须与系统中实际的J1939网络结构相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用与标准规定的通信管理器的接口和行为一致。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;channel&quot; of the function J1939Dcm_SetState.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
