                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1dc0e59e-4090-48b8-82d5-e6fa1850a9d7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939DcmNodeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to a J1939NmNode and provides access to the unique J1939NmNodeId.This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;node&quot; of the function J1939Dcm_SetState.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939DcmNodeRef 配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（DCM）在J1939网络中的节点引用，确保DCM能够正确地与其他节点进行通信。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939DcmNodeRef时，需要确保引用的节点已在系统中定义且与实际的网络拓扑相匹配；此配置项应与网络管理和地址分配机制兼容；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用与标准定义的网络层配置参数一致。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/J1939Nm/J1939NmConfigSet/J1939NmNode</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:13ed9523-106f-495c-b124-1dcaa1728ae2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939RmStateSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a switch of the J1939 Request Managers network state for a J1939 node. J1939Rm_SetState is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939RmStateSwitch 配置项用于定义基本软件模块J1939路由管理器（J1939Rm）的状态切换逻辑，控制J1939网络管理通信和节点状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保状态切换逻辑与系统需求和J1939协议标准一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对J1939Rm的实现和配置有具体要求，需要遵循这些要求；在多节点系统中，应考虑节点间的交互和状态同步，以保证网络管理的正确性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00998</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f0ab641-c737-401b-ad12-30cf65983da7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939RmRequestedState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the communication state of the J1939 Request Manager and corresponds to the parameter &quot;new state&quot; of the function J1939Rm_SetState.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939RmRequestedState 配置项用于定义BSW模块J1939 Request Manager的请求状态，这通常涉及到网络管理和诊断请求的处理。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该状态与系统中其他网络管理配置一致；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，应检查该配置项是否支持所需的网络管理策略；在多网络环境中，应注意不同网络间状态管理的一致性和冲突避免。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
