                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:fb073d77-c7d2-4661-b82f-e223311da2c0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939RmChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to the unique channel defined by the ComMChannel and provides access to the unique channel index value in ComMChannelId.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939RmChannelRef 配置项用于指定J1939通信管理模块（J1939Rm）与特定的CAN通道之间的关联。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，必须确保引用的CAN通道已经定义且与J1939Rm模块兼容；如果项目中使用了多个CAN通道，需要为每个使用J1939协议的通道配置相应的BswMJ1939RmChannelRef；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于J1939通信的配置可能有特定的参数要求，需要根据标准文档进行准确配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;channel&quot; of the function J1939Rm_SetState.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:13e3e6c9-3e2e-4068-ba2e-32a2629034bd">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMJ1939RmNodeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to a J1939NmNode and provides access to the unique J1939NmNodeId.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMJ1939RmNodeRef 配置项是用于定义基于J1939网络管理的软件模块（BswM）中节点的引用，确保网络管理策略能够正确地与特定的节点关联。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMJ1939RmNodeRef时，需要确保引用的节点已经在系统中定义，并且与网络管理策略相匹配；此配置项应与J1939网络管理的其他配置保持一致性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的数据类型和结构来定义节点引用。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;node&quot; of the function J1939Rm_SetState.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/J1939Nm/J1939NmConfigSet/J1939NmNode</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:23b5f4bd-fb88-4b60-b666-96efbced6dcc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMLinScheduleSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to a switch of LIN schedule table. LinSM_ScheduleRequest is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMLinScheduleSwitch 配置项用于管理LIN通信调度表的切换，允许基于不同的运行时条件动态选择合适的调度表。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保在使用BswMLinScheduleSwitch时，系统中已定义了多个LIN调度表以支持动态切换；此配置项应与LIN驱动的运行状态和事件触发机制紧密协调；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应遵循LIN通信管理模块的规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The configuration for the &quot;network&quot; parameter can be accessed via the reference LinSMComMNetworkHandleRef contained in the parent container LinSMChannel of the container referenced by BswMLinScheduleRef.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00827</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:32b27d57-fa6d-4f23-a0c7-f872b0d789a0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMLinScheduleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the LIN schedule table that the LIN SM shall change to.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMLinScheduleRef 是一个配置项，用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中LIN通信调度表的引用，确保LIN通信调度能够按照预定的策略进行。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMLinScheduleRef时，需要确保引用的LIN调度表在系统中是存在且有效的；此配置项通常与LIN通信管理和调度策略紧密相关；在多个调度表之间切换时，应考虑切换的时机和条件，以保证通信的连续性和正确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;schedule&quot; of the function LinSM_ScheduleRequest.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00842</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/LinSM/LinSMConfigSet/LinSMChannel/LinSMSchedule</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d44540a9-aa53-4e68-a8b5-ea3a59dcff78">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMNMControl</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to enabling and disabling of Network Management communication. Disabling of NM communication can be requested by DCM.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNMControl配置项用于定义网络管理通信控制的行为，它指定了基本软件模块（BswM）如何控制网络管理（NM）模块的状态和行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMNMControl时，需要确保与网络管理策略和需求相匹配；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能需要与其他网络管理配置项协同工作，以确保网络的正确管理和控制；配置时应注意不同网络通道的特定需求和特性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Nm_EnableCommunication or Nm_DisableCommunication is called when this action is configured.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00837</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0783d19-a6d0-4699-ac8c-a4049b4d461e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMNMAction</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the communication of the corresponding NM channel should be enabled or disabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMNMAction配置项用于定义网络管理通信状态机中的动作，这些动作是由网络管理模块在特定条件下执行的，以管理ECU的网络状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMNMAction时，需要确保动作与网络管理状态机的状态和转换逻辑相匹配；此外，应当遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于网络管理动作的定义和约束；在实现时，还需注意不同网络管理硬件和协议的特定要求，以确保动作的正确执行。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00838</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_NM_DISABLE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:edf3ec60-f51a-8fdd-4049-f692e3aadfbf">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_NM_DISABLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:06556486-d5e7-9058-42e5-c7bffe14eab7">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_NM_ENABLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:71f03668-a386-4d49-b226-dd2c739ebc06">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMComMNetworkHandleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to the unique channel defined by the ComMChannel and provides access to the unique channel index value in ComMChannelId.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMComMNetworkHandleRef配置项用于定义BswM模块与ComM模块之间的网络通道引用，确保BswM可以根据网络状态改变来执行相应的模式切换逻辑。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个BswMComMNetworkHandleRef正确映射到一个存在的ComM网络通道；在配置时需考虑网络通道的实际使用情况，避免错误引用；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应与网络管理需求紧密相关，确保配置的一致性和准确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;NetworkHandle&quot; of the function Nm_EnableCommunication and Nm_DisableCommunication.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00999</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b7e1d5b8-cc18-4508-bbbf-9257454d5c80">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduGroupSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes references to the PDU groups that shall be enabled and disabled.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduGroupSwitch配置项用于定义基本软件模块PDU组的开关状态，允许控制PDU组的传输或接收功能的启用或禁用。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMPduGroupSwitch时，需要确保PDU组的定义与系统中的通信需求相匹配；此外，切换PDU组状态时应注意对系统的影响，特别是在动态切换时对通信一致性和实时性的影响；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关的通信管理规范，确保配置的正确性和兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00828</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b6fb3fbb-cb5c-4d7a-9560-c5bc39a5da54">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduGroupSwitchReinit</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if the data of the I-PDU, the shadow buffers of included signal groups, etc. are reinitialized when a PDU Group is started.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduGroupSwitchReinit配置项用于定义在通信堆栈中，基础软件模块PDU组切换后是否需要重新初始化的行为，确保数据传输的连续性和正确性。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保在使用此配置项时考虑系统的实时性和安全要求；不恰当的使用可能导致数据一致性问题；此配置项的使用应与系统的通信需求和模块的初始化时间紧密相关。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter corresponds to the parameter &quot;initialize&quot; of the function Com_IpduGroupStart.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00913</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d63a77a6-da9d-467a-9c2f-6879f96a8b50">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMDisabledPduGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a PDU Group that should be disabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMDisabledPduGroupRef配置项用于引用在BswM模块中被禁用的PDU组，这允许基础软件模块管理器（BswM）控制PDU组的启用或禁用状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保引用的PDU组在系统中是存在的；BswM配置必须与PDU组配置保持一致，以避免运行时错误；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对PDU组的管理应遵循最新的规范和方法。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;IpduGroupId&quot; of the function Com_IpduGroupStop.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00850</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
