                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:40e0c9d2-b19e-4c8a-b501-1aac72a34ff5">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduRouterControl</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to enabling and disabling of routing of Routing Path Groups in the PDU Router. PduR_EnableRouting or PduR_DisableRouting is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduRouterControl配置项用于控制基础软件模块（BswM）中PDU路由器的行为，包括启用或禁用特定的PDU通道。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMPduRouterControl时，确保已定义所有需要路由的PDU通道；不正确的配置可能导致数据传输中断；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与通信堆栈的其他部分紧密协调，以保证数据的正确路由。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00853</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e5aff6a-3371-40e9-89e8-7a50b57f0e5c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduRouterDisableInitBuffer</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">When BswPduRouterAction is set to BSWM_PDUR_DISABLE and this parameter is set to true, then the call to PduR_DisableRouting will be invoked with parameter &quot;initialize&quot; set to true, otherwise false.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduRouterDisableInitBuffer 是一个配置项，用于指定是否在初始化时禁用PDU路由器的缓冲区初始化。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，通常PDU路由器的缓冲区在初始化时会被清零或设置为默认值，以确保数据的一致性和系统的可靠性；如果选择禁用缓冲区初始化，开发者需要确保这一决策不会导致系统中的数据不一致或其他潜在问题；此配置项的使用应当谨慎，并且在系统设计时充分评估其对系统行为的影响。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01036</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7a7d7b39-fdff-4f16-9aa1-9ea5d6b3f02f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduRouterAction</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the routing of the corresponding PDU should be enabled or disabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduRouterAction配置项定义了基本软件模块之间的PDU路由动作，包括PDU的源和目的模块，以及路由时可能执行的转换或过滤操作。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMPduRouterAction时，必须确保源和目的模块的兼容性和正确的数据流向；对于可能的转换或过滤操作，需要明确指定操作的类型和条件，确保数据的正确处理；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应当遵循PDU路由的相关规范和约束。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00854</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_PDUR_DISABLE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:1ff791d8-d8a6-9424-6c9d-a63aecb5c2df">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_PDUR_DISABLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:711758be-9312-8d26-607d-b527fccc5da3">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_PDUR_ENABLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:edbfb25c-322b-4d20-93f0-b1e32d0f50f5">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMPduRoutingPathGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the PDU Routing Path Group for which the routing in the PDU Router should be enabled or disabled.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMPduRoutingPathGroupRef 是一个配置项，用于引用一组PDU路由路径，这些路径定义了基本软件模块如何处理和转发网络上的消息数据单元（PDU）。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMPduRoutingPathGroupRef时，必须确保引用的PDU路由路径组在系统中是存在且有效的；此配置项通常与网络管理和通信堆栈的配置紧密相关，因此需要与相关网络配置保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用符合PDU路由的模块规范和约束。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;id&quot; of the function PduR_EnableRouting and PduR_DisableRouting.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00855</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/PduR/PduRRoutingPaths/PduRRoutingPathGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:662a5d37-c256-4df2-9c34-863871ee3cdf">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines a mode request that the BswM may send to a SW-C which is acting as a mode-manager. RTE_Write is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeRequest配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）如何请求运行时环境（RTE）改变模式。这通常涉及到BswM通知RTE切换到不同的功能模式，以便控制软件组件的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRteModeRequest时，必须确保所请求的模式与RTE中定义的模式一致；此外，BswM和RTE之间的接口必须正确配置以支持模式请求；最后，考虑到模式管理的实时性要求，应当合理安排模式请求的触发时机。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:12fc2260-72db-4ed0-b7d9-b9e47d09b736">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMRequestedModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to the Mode Declaration used for the mode request</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRequestedModeRef用于引用BSW模块请求的特定模式，允许BSW Mode Manager（BswM）根据这些请求来控制和管理不同BSW模块间的模式切换。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模式与BSW模块的实际可用模式一致；在配置时考虑模式切换的依赖关系和优先级，以避免死锁或优先级反转问题；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是标准的，但实现方式可能因供应商而异，需参考具体的供应商文档。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01024</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:23127f7f-bea8-4098-a652-9c5f7470a6ed">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeRequestPortRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a BswMRteModeRequestPort.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeRequestPortRef 配置项用于指定基础软件模块（BswM）中的模式请求端口引用，这是BswM与RTE之间交互模式请求的接口。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRteModeRequestPortRef时，必须确保引用的端口是存在的且正确配置了模式声明组；此配置项的正确性对于模式管理逻辑至关重要，错误的配置可能导致模式切换失败；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循模式管理的规范来配置此项，以保证系统的模式管理功能正常工作。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01023</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMModeControl/BswMRteModeRequestPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2c0a524a-b913-43a1-8844-cb5f4ce848b7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteStart</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the action to start the Rte from BswM.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteStart 是一个配置参数，用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）在初始化时调用RTE（Runtime Environment）启动函数的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保BswMRteStart配置与系统启动流程一致；通常此参数由系统生成工具配置，不建议手动修改；配置错误可能导致系统启动时序问题，影响整个软件的初始化和运行。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01073</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1d0bb17b-9fbb-4f2f-9042-6f9a9179bda0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteStop</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the action to stop the Rte from BswM</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteStop 是一个配置参数，用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）在系统停止时是否应该通知运行时环境（RTE）。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保系统停止过程中的所有通知都能正确配置以保证系统的安全停止；如果系统设计不需要BswM在停止时通知RTE，该配置应设置为不启用；在配置时应考虑系统的安全需求和停止策略。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01074</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3d4d94e4-a15a-4442-88ce-2c30ccbffbee">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines a mode switch indication that the BswM provides to the SW-C that need to be notified about the mode switch. RTE_Switch is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteSwitch 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用基本软件模块（BswM）与运行时环境（RTE）之间的接口，这影响BswM模块是否可以调用RTE提供的服务。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在启用BswMRteSwitch时，BswM模块与RTE之间的接口是正确配置的；如果不需要BswM模块与RTE之间的交互，则可以禁用此选项以节省资源；在配置此参数时，应考虑系统的整体架构和模块间的依赖关系。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00803</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:3d6f5054-ebed-40f3-9abc-b366bc6a8017">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwitchedMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the integer value that corresponds to a certain mode in a Mode Declaration Group.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwitchedMode配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）在不同模式下的行为，允许基于系统或网络状态的变化动态调整模块的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个模式的定义清晰且互斥，避免模式间的冲突；在设计模式切换逻辑时，考虑系统的实时性和稳定性；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是标准的一部分，但实现细节可能因AUTOSAR版本和供应商实现而异。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00896</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:4642d375-9c6d-4db5-84c5-fb8e6d59972c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteSwitchPortRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to the BswMSwitchPort.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteSwitchPortRef配置项用于指定基础软件模块（BswM）与运行时环境（RTE）之间的交互接口，确保BswM可以通过特定的端口引用与RTE进行通信。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项确保了BswM模块与RTE之间的数据交换和控制流的正确性；在配置时需确保引用的端口存在且可用；此配置项对于实现BswM模块的逻辑控制至关重要，需谨慎处理。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00952</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMModeControl/BswMSwitchPort</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:07525aab-f7a7-4e5b-a6b0-762131ec234d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSchMSwitch</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines a mode switch indication that the BswM provides to the SW-C that need to be notified about the mode switch. SchM_Switch is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSchMSwitch 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用基本软件模块调度管理器（BswMSchM）的功能开关。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSchMSwitch时，需要确保它与系统的需求和其他模块的配置相兼容；如果禁用了BswMSchM，那么依赖于调度管理器的功能将无法工作；在修改此配置项之前，应仔细评估对系统行为的影响。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00899</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:b599b803-1f49-4f69-9a5e-559518402d1a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSchMModeDeclarationGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is the reference to a ModeDeclarationGroup to define a ModeDeclarationGroupPrototype in the role BswModuleDescription.providedModeGroup.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSchMModeDeclarationGroupRef是一个配置项，用于引用模式声明组，该组定义了基本软件模块（BswM）可以管理的不同模式。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模式声明组在系统中是唯一定义的；该配置项对于实现模式管理逻辑至关重要，需要仔细配置以避免运行时错误；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，模式管理的配置和实现应遵循标准的模式声明和管理机制。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01031</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION-GROUP</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8223503b-58a4-4608-9fe1-4317c3c27858">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSchMSwitchedMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter contains the integer value that corresponds to a certain mode in a Mode Declaration Group.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSchMSwitchedMode配置项用于定义基本软件模块调度管理器（BswMScheduler）中的模式切换逻辑，它指定了在不同模式下，哪些BswMSchedulableEntities应当被激活或停用。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSchMSwitchedMode时，必须确保所有参与���式切换的BswMSchedulableEntities已经被正确定义；模式切换逻辑应与系统的功能安全要求相符合；在实现模式切换时，需要考虑切换的原子性和一致性，避免出现中间状态导致的系统不稳定。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00901</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-DECLARATION</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:810b987b-0f74-4aaf-a085-9e710bbbc456">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdClientServiceModeRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to the selection of an client service of Sd. Sd_ClientServiceSetState is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdClientServiceModeRequest配置项用于定义基础软件模块服务（BswM）客户端请求的模式，这些模式请求可以触发BswM来改变内部管理的模式，从而影响系统行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保请求的模式与BswM模块定义的模式一致；应当注意模式请求的优先级，以避免不必要的模式冲突；在多客户端环境中，需要协调不同客户端对同一模式的请求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00974</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6bd04e01-fe53-4e12-9c3d-71a9e8a47e20">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdClientServiceState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the corresponding client service shall be released or requested.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdClientServiceState 配置项用于定义基本软件模块服务发现客户端的状态，这些状态通常包括请求服务、服务就绪和服务不可用等。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSdClientServiceState时，需要确保状态的定义与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中的服务发现状态机模型保持一致；状态转换应当遵循标准定义的逻辑和条件；在实现时，应当考虑服务状态变化对系统其他部分的影响，确保系统的稳定性和可靠性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01016</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
