                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c9b2c771-cb6a-42cb-851d-ccad562fec04">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdConsumedEventGroupModeRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to the selection of a consumed EventGroup of Sd. Sd_ConsumedEventGroupSetState is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdConsumedEventGroupModeRequest配置项用于定义基础软件模块请求改变某个消费事件组的模式的能力，这通常涉及到服务发现机制中的动态事件组管理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保事件组的模式请求与服务提供者的模式能力相匹配；此配置项在设计服务发现和事件管理策略时尤为重要，需要仔细规划；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对服务发现和事件组模式管理提供了详细的规范，确保遵循这些规范以保证系统的兼容性和稳定性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f60a0167-f85e-4d3c-b49d-e82c06af6b60">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdConsumedEventGroupState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the corresponding consumed event group shall be released or requested.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdConsumedEventGroupState配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）中消费的事件组的状态，这些状态通常用于BswM逻辑中以决定不同的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保事件组的状态与实际的系统状态机制相匹配；BswM配置应与通信管理和网络管理模块紧密协调，以确保状态的正确传递和处理；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关的模块间接口规范和数据类型定义。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01017</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_SD_CONSUMED_EVENTGROUP_RELEASED</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:a1429456-ed05-9065-426f-a539bec1c922">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_SD_CONSUMED_EVENTGROUP_RELEASED</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f1fc24fd-d804-90b5-409f-d778b9cd52ca">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_SD_CONSUMED_EVENTGROUP_REQUESTED</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:3075cf2a-8dbf-89e4-1aa8-9bd34c6a358d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdConsumedEventGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to an eventGroup that is defined within a client service in the Sd module.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdConsumedEventGroupRef 配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中的一个消费事件组引用，这通常与网络管理或通信管理相关联，用于处理来自其他ECUs的事件通知。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，需要确保引用的事件组与BswM模块的期望行为相匹配；此配置项应与网络配置和通信矩阵保持一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保使用正确的引用格式和数据类型，以避免集成时的兼容性问题。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01010</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Sd/SdConfig/SdInstance/SdClientService/SdConsumedEventGroup</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8f559f0e-0d39-426c-9604-d38eead59bca">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdServerServiceModeRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to the selection of a server service of Sd. Sd_ServerServiceSetState is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdServerServiceModeRequest配置项用于定义基础软件模块服务（BswM）在服务发现（Sd）服务器请求特定服务模式时的行为，确保系统能够根据服务请求调整其运行模式。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保服务模式请求与系统中定义的服务模式匹配；此配置项对系统的服务管理策略有直接影响，需谨慎配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对服务发现的管理和配置有详细规定，需遵守相关规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01005</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4bc0c4e3-682a-40c8-bb76-c6dda289703d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdServerServiceState</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies if the corresponding server service shall be down or available.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdServerServiceState 配置项用于定义基本软件模块服务发现（Service Discovery）服务器的服务状态，这通常涉及服务的可用性和服务注册的状态。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSdServerServiceState时，需要确保状态的定义与系统中服务发现的实际需求相匹配；此配置项应与服务发现策略和服务注册机制紧密结合；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，务必遵循相关的服务发现规范和约定，以保证服务状态的正确性和一致性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01015</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_SD_SERVER_SERVICE_AVAILABLE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:02254d37-8c8e-844e-36b8-46dec6fedc83">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_SD_SERVER_SERVICE_AVAILABLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b541ea89-2510-8de2-4ea6-8371f2a415ef">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_SD_SERVER_SERVICE_DOWN</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:705cafe5-af0d-460a-85df-04e1b5f5f0c7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSdServerMethodsRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to a server service in the Sd module.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSdServerMethodsRef配置项用于引用基本软件模块（BswM）中定义的服务发现（Service Discovery）服务器方法，它关联了BswM模块与服务发现的服务器方法实现。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSdServerMethodsRef时，需要确保引用的服务器方法与实际实现的服务发现逻辑相匹配；此配置项通常由系统设计者根据系统架构和通信需求进行设置；在多服务环境中，正确的服务方法引用对于服务发现的准确性和效率至关重要。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01007</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Sd/SdConfig/SdInstance/SdServerService</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:239dfa77-aac8-4c83-a5e7-1be8c85669a5">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwitchIPduMode</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to the selection of the transmission mode an I-PDU to be sent by COM. Com_SwitchIpduTxMode is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwitchIPduMode配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）如何根据不同的网络管理状态切换IPDU（Protocol Data Unit）的发送或接收模式，以优化网络通信效率和满足不同操作模式下的网络需求。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSwitchIPduMode时，需要确保每个IPDU的模式切换逻辑与实际网络管理需求相匹配；此配置项对于网络带宽优化和减少不必要的网络通信非常关键；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于IPDU模式切换的具体实现细节有明确规范，需要仔细遵守以保证兼容性和系统的可靠性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00958</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:75026229-698c-4fbc-a905-6652e28355d6">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwitchIPduModeValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines which transmission mode shall be selected during this call.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwitchIPduModeValue 配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）中，IPDU（PDU路由器）模式切换的值，这个值决定了IPDU的传输模式。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSwitchIPduModeValue时，需要确保其值与PduR模块中定义的IPDU模式一致；此外，该值通常与ECU状态或网络管理事件相关联，因此需要确保与这些条件的映射正确无误；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间接口定义和数据类型约定，以保证模块间的兼容性和正确的行为。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This parameter corresponds to the parameter &quot;Mode&quot; of the function Com_SwitchIpduTxMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00960</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:2629fedf-9668-4d93-af1e-99e2346f915f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwitchIPduModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to an I-PDU for which the transmission mode shall be set.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwitchIPduModeRef 配置项用于引用一个或多个IPDU模式，这些模式定义了BswM模块在特定模式下如何管理IPDU（网络数据单元）的发送和接收。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSwitchIPduModeRef时，需要确保引用的IPDU模式与BswM模块的模式管理策略相匹配；引用的IPDU模式必须在系统中定义且有效；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的数据类型和结构来引用IPDU模式。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;PduId&quot; of the function Com_SwitchIpduTxMode.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00959</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Com/ComConfig/ComIPdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a09ebaf2-4e88-460a-a045-709607ead67e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMTimerControl</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters for the action to start or to stop a timer.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTimerControl配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）中定时器的控制逻辑，包括定时器的启动、停止以及超时时间的设置，以支持基于时间的服务和管理功能。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTimerControl时，需要确保定时器的超时时间与系统的实时性要求相匹配；定时器的控制逻辑应避免引入不必要的系统开销；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能未明确定义，需参考具体的BswM模块实现和供应商文档。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01059</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:792856f6-967a-4e60-b583-8fa877edb9b1">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMTimerAction</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Specify the action for the timer. The timer can be started or stopped.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTimerAction配置项用于定义基本软件模块中的定时器动作，它指定了当定时器到期时应该执行的回调函数。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTimerAction时，需要确保回调函数符合AUTOSAR标准中对定时器到期回调的要求；定时器的精度和分辨率应满足系统的实时性要求；在多任务环境中，应考虑定时器回调的执行上下文和优先级。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                          <SDGS>
                                            <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                              <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                            </SDG>
                                          </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01060</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_TIMER_START</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                      <LITERALS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:5e8e91b1-8b4c-902d-2e8f-5e0595301073">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_TIMER_START</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:71e2163d-3f4d-87fd-3e13-f7876aaec76c">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_TIMER_STOP</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                      </LITERALS>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:01a6b8a8-7340-4139-ba9c-e79994369462">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMTimerValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Specify the timer value (in seconds) that is used when the timer is started.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTimerValue配置项用于定义基础软件模块计时器的时间值，这是一个用于控制或监测时间相关行为的参数。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：配置成0代表停止timer，该配置项的值需根据实际的时间需求和系统的时钟精度来设定；过小的值可能导致计时器过快溢出，而过大的值可能影响计时精度；在配置时需考虑目标硬件的时钟频率和可用的计时器资源。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01061</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="OPEN">Inf</MAX>
                                      <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9898cf88-69f0-4a20-b228-84a458422911">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMTimerRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Specify the Timer for which the timer action shall be executed.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTimerRef是一个配置项，用于引用操作系统中定义的定时器，它允许基础软件模块（BswM）使用这些定时器来管理和监控时间相关的行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTimerRef时，需要确保引用的定时器在操作系统中已经定义并正确配置；此外，定时器的分辨率和范围应满足BswM模块的时间管理需求；在多任务环境中，还需考虑定时器的访问冲突和同步问题。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMModeRequestPort/BswMModeRequestSource/BswMTimer</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5e313869-250f-44b6-964e-4dbda0dc8af8">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMTriggerIPduSend</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all parameters related to the triggering of an I-PDU to be sent by COM. Com_TriggerIPDUSend is called when this action is configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTriggerIPduSend配置项用于定义BswM模块何时触发IPDU（即网络数据单元）的发送，这通常与CAN、LIN或其他通信堆栈的交互有关。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTriggerIPduSend时，需要确保与通信堆栈的配置相匹配，以避免发送触发不一致的问题；此配置项应与BswM的模式管理和规则检查机制紧密集成，以确保在正确的模式下触发IPDU发送；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间通信接口的定义和规范，以保证系统的可靠性和一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00906</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:bf813042-367e-403f-849e-eb3d8b1c950f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMTriggeredIPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This is a reference to an I-PDU that should be triggered for transmission.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMTriggeredIPduRef是一个配置项，用于在BswM模块中引用一个触发式的IPDU，这样BswM可以根据IPDU的发送或接收来决定执行特定的模式切换逻辑。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMTriggeredIPduRef时，需要确保所引用的IPDU确实是触发式的，并且与BswM模块的模式切换逻辑相匹配；此外，引用的IPDU必须在系统中存在且正确配置，以保证BswM的正确运行；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块间通信和数据交换原则，确保数据的一致性和模块的协同工作。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This reference corresponds to the parameter &quot;PduId&quot; of the function Com_TriggerIPDUSend.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00907</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Com/ComConfig/ComIPdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1c998532-6f53-42ea-9dad-4825df61605a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMUserCallout</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all details needed for a user defined function call.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMUserCallout配置项用于定义BswM模块中用户自定义的回调函数，这些回调函数可以在BswM的不同决策点被调用，以执行特定的用户定义行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：用户定义的回调函数需要遵循AUTOSAR标准中定义的特定原型；确保回调函数的执行时间尽可能短，避免影响系统的实时性；在配置BswMUserCallout时，应确保回调函数与BswM模块的交互不会引入任何不确定性或安全风险。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00834</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:40b9feb6-e998-4e06-a351-81f431b4850e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMUserCalloutFunction</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies the complete function call including all parameters. The parameters are specified during configuration time, and cannot be changed during run time. Any return values passed by the callout will be ignored.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMUserCalloutFunction配置项用于定义BswM（Basis Software Module Management）模块在执行模式切换前后调用的用户自定义函数，允许在模式切换的过程中加入特定的用户逻辑。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：用户定义的回调函数需要遵循AUTOSAR规范中定义的函数原型和调用约定；确保回调函数的执行时间尽可能短，避免影响系统的实时性；在配置时需确保函数的可靠性和安全性，避免引入系统不稳定因素。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Example usage can be:
                                                                        Actions to initialize other BSW modules
                                                                        Action to call NvM_ReadAll()
                                                                        Action to call NvM_WriteAll()</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:407b970e-46be-4d6b-b8ad-157663aa5d94">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMActionList</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this container defines an action list that is invoked based on the BswM Rules. An action list contains a list of numbered action items to be processed. An action list can also include other action lists.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMActionList是AUTOSAR BSW模块管理器（BswM）的配置参数，用于定义一系列的动作（Actions），这些动作在满足特定的逻辑表达式后将被执行。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMActionList时，需要确保动作列表中的动作与对应的模式请求和决策逻辑相匹配；动作列表中的每个动作都应该有明确的执行条件和顺序；在配置动作时，应注意不同动作之间的依赖关系和潜在的资源冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00809</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>4294967295</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e6f03759-bac9-40cb-816c-4432a6d70644">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMActionListExecution</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter controls if the corresponding action list shall be executed every time the rule is evaluated or only when the result of the evaluation changes. This parameter does not have an effect when this action list is executed within another action list.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMActionListExecution配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）中的动作列表执行属性，这些属性决定了动作列表在特定条件下的执行时机和行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMActionListExecution时，需要确保动作列表与触发它们的模式请求之间的关系正确无误；此外，应当注意动作列表的执行优先级，以避免执行顺序上的冲突；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还需要确保动作列表的执行不会违反系统的实时性要求或造成资源竞争。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00894</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>BSWM_TRIGGER</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d655647-7259-99c2-3b19-7e3f81d3dc32">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_CONDITION</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f863a919-8799-9a03-5062-0b9c594b1590">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BSWM_TRIGGER</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:57ce84a2-0f20-4dd5-85a3-4fd44d75b91a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMActionListItem</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines an item in an action list.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMActionListItem配置项用于定义基本软件模块管理（BswM）的行为列表项，它指定了在特定条件下应当执行的动作序列。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMActionListItem时，需要确保动作的顺序和条件与系统需求相匹配；此外，每个行为列表项应当与相应的BswMModeRequestTrigger或BswMRule关联；在配置过程中，还需注意不同动作之间的依赖关系和潜在的资源冲突。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00823</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:79c629de-d4aa-49d9-b686-9a6bd7347aec">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMAbortOnFail</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines if the exec_mode of the action list shall be aborted if this specific action returns E_NOT_OK. Note that this is only applicable for actions that have E_NOT_OK as a possible return value.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMAbortOnFail配置项用于指定当BswM模块中的某个模式请求失败时，是否应中止当前操作或继续执行后续操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需考虑系统的容错需求和安全要求；错误处理策略应与系统的整体异常管理策略保持一致；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确定义，需根据具体实现和版本要求进行考虑。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00902</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d2944d1c-b5c4-4d6b-bc4c-ae6c1a89e946">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMActionListItemIndex</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the index of the action in the action list. It is used define in which order the actions shall be performed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">(1, TypeError(&quot;'AssertionError' object is not subscriptable&quot;))</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00824</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:bd991f62-09da-46a5-ade1-7e7101985841">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMReportFailRuntimeErrorId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter is configured, and this specific action returns E_NOT_OK, the BswM will report a Det Runtime Error.  The ErrorId reported in the Runtime Error is given by the value configured in this parameter.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMReportFailRuntimeErrorId用于定义在基础软件模块管理（BswM）中报告运行时错误的唯一标识符，该标识符用于识别和处理特定的运行时错误。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该标识符必须在系统中唯一，以避免错误处理的混淆；在配置时应确保与系统中其他错误报告机制的标识符不冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求错误处理机制能够准确地识别和响应各种运行时错误，因此正确配置此项至关重要。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01050</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>128</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>128</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:756c431f-9e65-40e8-b3a3-47599991abcb">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMActionListItemRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">The action item can either be an atomic action or a reference to another action list or rule.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00825</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REFS>
                                    <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMModeControl/BswMAction</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMModeControl/BswMActionList</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/BswM/BswMConfig/BswMArbitration/BswMRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                                  </DESTINATION-REFS>
                                </ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:aab60461-fba3-4814-b333-1490351da9f4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeRequestPort</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container defines a mode request port which the BswM may utilize to send a mode request to a SW-C which is acting as a mode-manager.  If this container is referenced by a BswMRteModeRequest, the BswM shall create a corresponding PPort in its service description.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeRequestPort配置项用于定义基础软件模块（BswM）与运行时环境（RTE）之间的模式请求端口，允许BswM请求RTE切换特定模式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保端口的唯一性和正确性，以保证模式请求能够正确传递；此配���项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与BswM模块的模式管理功能紧密集成，确保模式切换请求的一致性和实时性；配置时应注意与相关的RTE模式声明保持一致，避免模式匹配错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01022</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cba7f33a-f9e8-4ee6-961d-2b162728d525">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeRequestVariableDataPrototypeSRRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This is a foreign reference to a VariableDataPrototype used for the mode request.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeRequestVariableDataPrototypeSRRef 是一个配置项，用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中的模式请求变量与软件组件（Swc）提供的模式声明组（ModeDeclarationGroup）之间的关联。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，必须确保模式请求变量与正确的模式声明组相对应；模式声明组需要在系统描述中预先定义；此配置项对于实现BswM逻辑和Swc之间的模式管理交互至关重要。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01057</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-TYPE>VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                            </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8b6ebe75-8fca-455a-b7c8-3a24bd76a80a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMRteModeRequestPortInterfaceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This is an instance reference to the variable data prototype used for the mode request.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMRteModeRequestPortInterfaceRef 配置项用于指定基本软件模块（BswM）中用于请求模式切换的RTE端口接口的引用。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMRteModeRequestPortInterfaceRef时，必须确保引用的RTE端口接口与BswM模块的模式管理需求相匹配；引用的接口应已在系统中定义且符合AUTOSAR标准的接口规范；在配置过程中，应注意接口的一致性和正确性，避免引用错误或不存在的接口。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01025</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-CONTEXT>SW-COMPONENT-PROTOTYPE*PORT-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-CONTEXT>
                              <DESTINATION-TYPE>VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                            </ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f962bf44-5314-4e9c-894b-e8cf24f38351">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BswMSwitchPort</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container includes a reference to mode switch interface which the BswM must instantiate for the creation of a PPortPrototype in its SWCD.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMSwitchPort配置项用于定义基本软件模块（BswM）中的端口开关，它控制不同软件模块间的通信路径，以及模块内部功能的启用或禁用。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMSwitchPort时，必须确保端口的状态转换逻辑与系统需求相匹配，避免因错误配置导致通信故障；此外，AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于端口开关的配置和管理提供了详细的规范，需要仔细遵守以保证兼容性和系统的稳定性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00950</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:868ddf33-9a9f-4e55-9dcb-598cd2bed53a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>BswMModeSwitchInterfaceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ModeSwitchInterface of this BswMModeSwitchPort.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMModeSwitchInterfaceRef 配置项用于引用模式切换接口，它指定了基础软件模块（BswM）与其他模块间的模式切换通信接口。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的模式切换接口与实际的模块定义一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对模式切换接口的实现和使用有特定的要求，需要遵守这些要求；在多模块协作环境中，要注意模式切换的同步和一致性问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00951</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-TYPE>MODE-SWITCH-INTERFACE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                            </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fa61d6da-9eb0-40f5-91ad-14a6c6302f8f">
                  <SHORT-NAME>BswMGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">General configuration parameters of the Basic SW Mode Manager.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMGeneral 是 AUTOSAR BSW Module Management的一个配置容器，它包含了基本的模块管理配置参数，如模块的开启或关闭状态、开发错误检测等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMGeneral时，需要确保配置参数与系统需求相匹配；开发错误检测（Development Error Detection）应根据项目的调试和发布需求来启用或禁用；如果配置了模块为关闭状态，则相关的BswM功能将不会被编译或执行。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00800</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:20b09b71-af6c-4742-bc19-d7be46ef2c56">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">enable/disable CanSM module related BswM API:</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMEnabled 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用CAN状态管理器（CanSM）模块在BswM（基础软件模块管理器）中的功能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置BswMCanSMEnabled时，需要确保CAN网络管理需求与BswM模块的策略一致；如果项目不使用BswM对CanSM的管理，则该配置项应设置为禁用；在配置时应参照具体项目的网络管理需求和架构设计来决定该配置项的启用状态。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00938</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
