                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5407f048-2221-413a-a949-f095f6b4817c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMCanSMIcomEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">enable/disable CanSM Icom related BswM API:</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMCanSMIcomEnabled 是一个布尔型配置参数，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理接口(CanSM)的Icom(Integration Communication)支持，这是为了优化网络管理策略和降低网络带宽消耗。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保硬件和底层CAN驱动支持Icom功能；如果项目不使用Icom或硬件不支持，应将此配置项设置为false；在配置时应参照具体的AUTOSAR CAN网络管理模块规范，确保与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准的要求一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_01029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
