                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d8e85281-44c8-4346-9f78-2dc8123999ce">
                      <SHORT-NAME>BswMDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：BswMDevErrorDetect是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用基本软件模块管理（BswM）的开发错误检测功能，以便在开发阶段识别配置或运行时错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常禁用此功能以优化性能；确保在开发和测试阶段启用以捕获潜在错误；与AUTOSAR 4.4标准一致，无特殊不一致事项。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_BswM_00811</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
