        <AR-PACKAGE>
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDestinationUriDefSets</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF-SET>
              <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsUriDefSet</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESTINATION-URI-DEFS>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandler</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:34a06182-a4e4-4f79-b61d-3c3d2785a14a">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container describes an invocation handler function implemented by an RTE Implementation Plug-In to handle the invocation of server runnables and triggered runnables via a transformer.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc是一个配置项，用于指定RTE（Runtime Environment）中的RIPS（RTE Invocation Proxy Stubs）调用处理函数，该函数负责管理客户端和服务器之间的通信调用。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc时，需要确保该函数与系统中的通信机制兼容；此外，该函数的实现必须满足AUTOSAR标准中对时间和资源使用的要求；在多核或分布式系统中，还需考虑跨核或跨ECU的调用问题。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79007</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:de1cd0f2-18ae-49d1-bd49-2f907d1e6a22">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandlerFncSymbol</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">C-Symbol of the Rte_Rips_FillFlushRoutine function.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsInvocationHandlerFncSymbol是用于定义RTE生成代码中，某个RTE调用点（RIPS，RTE Invocation Point Symbol）的处理函数符号名称，这使得RTE层可以通过这个符号来调用底层软件组件的具体实现。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的命名需要遵循项目或组织内部的命名规范，以确保一致性和可读性；在大型项目中，建议使用自动化工具来管理这些符号名称，避免手动错误；符号名称应避免使用保留字或可能引起混淆的名称。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79008</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        </PARAMETERS>
                      </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    </CONTAINERS>
                    <DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>TARGET-CONTAINER</DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>
                  </DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                </ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPlugin</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b6b8f564-5772-4d48-8070-096066463e73">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginProps</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the identity of the Rte Implementation Plug-in and provides the RTE relevant parameters of the Rte Implementation Plug-in.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsPluginProps 是用于配置与 RTE 相关的插件属性，这些属性可以影响代码生成和运行时行为。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保插件属性与系统需求和硬件配置相匹配；不正确的配置可能导致性能下降或功能不符合预期；在多核或分布式系统中特别注意插件的兼容性和配置一致性。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <INTRODUCTION>
                          <P>
                            <L-1 L="EN">The shortName of the container defines the name of the Rte Implementation Plug-in used for the API infixes.</L-1>
                          </P>
                        </INTRODUCTION>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf86cf97-8cda-40c8-b23e-8d57afcc1b1a">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RtePluginSupportsIReadIWrite</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Denotes if or if not the plug-in supports the Rte_Rips_IRead/IWrite macros for primitive data.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RtePluginSupportsIReadIWrite 配置项指示RTE是否支持IRead和IWrite接口，这些接口用于简化数据元素的读写操作。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，IRead和IWrite接口的支持是可选的，因此需要根据项目需求决定是否启用；如果��用，需要确保软件组件正确实现了这些接口；在配置时，应检查与软件组件的兼容性，以确保接口的正确使用。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                          <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:36dd9691-7575-449b-91c5-9cc966eb3f77">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsGlobalCopyInstantiationPolicy</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Globally enables or disables the support for Rte Implementation Plug-Ins (RIPS)</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsGlobalCopyInstantiationPolicy 配置项用于定义AUTOSAR RTE（Runtime Environment）中的全局数据拷贝实例化策略，决定了如何处理跨分区通信中的数据拷贝。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置跨分区通信时，需要根据系统资源和性能要求选择合适的数据拷贝策略；此配置项对系统的内存使用和通信效率有直接影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有特定的限制或建议，需要确保配置与标准一致。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_RTE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_PLUGIN</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            <LITERALS>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c11e729-cd9e-84ea-4c6c-7821d4e46513">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_PLUGIN</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:3bafee16-2876-8b5d-3c19-3bf2f1cfcb2c">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_RTE</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            </LITERALS>
                          </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        </PARAMETERS>
                      </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    </CONTAINERS>
                    <DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>TARGET-CONTAINER</DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>
                  </DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                </ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutine</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:82bac640-768a-4f73-b758-5aa570fb2f23">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutineFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container describes a Fill-Flush Routine function implemented by a RTE Implementation Plug-In to handle the buffering for implicit communication.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutineFnc配置项用于指定RTE与底层硬件交互时，填充和刷新数据的插件函数，这些函数由RTE在读写I/O硬件时调用。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保所指定的函数符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于插件函数的定义和调用约定；函数的实现必须保证数据的正确填充和刷新，以及在多任务环境下的线程安全；如果项目中没有使用到特定的硬件交互，该配置项可能不需要配置。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a603e53b-750c-44d9-9a4e-1dde1cfcf212">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsModeDisablingHandling</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">This parameter configures whether mode disabling dependencies are considered for the invocation of Rte_Rips_FillFlushRoutines.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsModeDisablingHandling配置项用于定义AUTOSAR RTE（Run-Time Environment）如何处理因模式禁用导致的Runnable实体的启动请求，确保系统在不同模式下的行为符合预期。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在设计时需考虑不同模式下Runnable的启动策略，以避免非预期行为；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确提及此配置项，可能属于特定实现或版本的扩展；在应用此配置项时，应详细了解其在具体AUTOSAR RTE实现中的行为和限制。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>RTE_RIPS_CONSIDER_MODE_DISABLINGS</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            <LITERALS>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:37effb69-0aba-908f-4a2a-70f8b557b791">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_CONSIDER_MODE_DISABLINGS</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b85b3d32-4206-90c4-365c-2bde3dea8e96">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_IGNORE_MODE_DISABLINGS</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            </LITERALS>
                          </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fc058c69-870b-4a9d-bf00-7983619badff">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsOsSchedulePoint</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Introduce a schedule point by explicitly calling Os Schedule service after the exec_mode of the Rte_Rips_FillFlushRoutine.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsOsSchedulePoint配置项用于定义AUTOSAR运行时环境（RTE）中的调度点，这些调度点指示操作系统(OS)在执行特定任务或中断服务例程(ISR)时，何时应该检查并可能切换到其他任务或ISR。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteRipsOsSchedulePoint时，需要确保调度点的设置不会导致系统性能下降，特别是在高实时性要求的系统中；调度点的选择和配置应与系统的调度策略和任务优先级设置相匹配，以避免优先级反转等问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对调度点的具体实现和配置方法可能有详细规定，需要仔细遵守标准指导。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
